<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<tt
  xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml"
  xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata"
  xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling"
  xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter"
  ttp:cellResolution="384 288"
  xml:lang="eng">
  <head>
    <layout>
      <region xml:id="Default"
        tts:origin="3% 0%"
        tts:extent="97% 97%"
        tts:displayAlign="after"
        tts:textAlign="center"
        tts:fontSize="16c"
        tts:fontFamily="Arial"
        tts:overflow="visible" />
    </layout>
  </head>
  <body>
    <div>
      <p
        begin="00:01:02.416"
        end="00:01:03.416"><span region="Default">Camera and sound.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:01:04.250"
        end="00:01:05.166"><span region="Default">Babu Reddy Babu.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:01:06.125"
        end="00:01:07.125"><span region="Default">Start camera.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:01:08.000"
        end="00:01:11.125"><span region="Default">Action!</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:01:18.708"
        end="00:01:20.041"><span region="Default">This one is nature.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:01:20.250"
        end="00:01:21.333"><span region="Default">The other one is destruction.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:01:21.416"
        end="00:01:24.416"><span region="Default">Hold onto that bond.<br/>Break this one.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:01:30.291"
        end="00:01:33.708"><span region="Default">If you harm an innocent child,<br/>will the Almighty stay silent?</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:01:33.791"
        end="00:01:35.708"><span region="Default">Oh, Lord!</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:01:42.250"
        end="00:01:44.875"><span region="Default">Akhanda Rudra Shikandar Ghora.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:01:45.416"
        end="00:01:46.666"><span region="Default">Lord Shiva.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:01:46.750"
        end="00:01:47.875"><span region="Default">I am He.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:01:48.375"
        end="00:01:52.000"><span region="Default">In this life, Lord Shiva is my father,<br/>and the Mother of the world, my mother.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:01:56.750"
        end="00:02:00.625"><span region="Default">For the sake of one prayer,<br/>for all beings to be happy,</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:02:00.708"
        end="00:02:04.083"><span region="Default">they go anywhere, perform rituals,</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:02:04.166"
        end="00:02:06.458"><span region="Default">and if needed, wage wars.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:02:12.166"
        end="00:02:14.541"><span region="Default">-Aren't you human, like us?<br/>-Never.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:02:14.708"
        end="00:02:18.083"><span region="Default">For you, family is the world.<br/>For us, the world means family.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:02:18.291"
        end="00:02:19.916"><span region="Default">Both are not the same.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:02:25.416"
        end="00:02:29.458"><span region="Default">Be it hardship, tears,<br/>or even death itself,</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:02:29.666"
        end="00:02:33.083"><span region="Default">no matter where I am, in whatever state,<br/>I'll stand before you in a moment.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:02:34.041"
        end="00:02:36.125"><span region="Default">This is my promise!</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:02:53.000"
        end="00:02:56.250"><span region="Default">We've read in the scriptures, ma'am,<br/>that whenever sin crosses its limits,</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:02:56.333"
        end="00:02:57.875"><span region="Default">the Almighty descends.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:02:58.125"
        end="00:03:01.041"><span region="Default">Now, I've seen it's true.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:03:04.625"
        end="00:03:07.458"><span region="Default">We thought,<br/>"Dharma protects those who protect it,"</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:03:07.875"
        end="00:03:11.125"><span region="Default">was impossible in this age of Kali.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:03:11.333"
        end="00:03:14.666"><span region="Default">So we wrote our own laws for safety.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:03:15.625"
        end="00:03:18.458"><span region="Default">But before the Dharma he spoke of,</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:03:19.000"
        end="00:03:22.708"><span region="Default">these laws felt too small, ma'am.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:03:25.750"
        end="00:03:26.708"><span region="Default">Mr. Perumal!</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:03:27.333"
        end="00:03:31.416"><span region="Default">Our nation is governed by law,<br/>not by personal beliefs.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:03:32.583"
        end="00:03:36.583"><span region="Default">If someone claims to walk the path of God<br/>and slaughters hundreds on the way,</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:03:37.250"
        end="00:03:38.583"><span region="Default">the law cannot simply look away.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:03:38.791"
        end="00:03:41.041"><span region="Default">He's… a criminal.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:03:42.500"
        end="00:03:43.541"><span region="Default">No, ma'am.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:03:44.041"
        end="00:03:46.916"><span region="Default">You're judging his deeds.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:03:47.000"
        end="00:03:50.583"><span region="Default">I'm referring to his deeper purpose.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:03:51.333"
        end="00:03:54.083"><span region="Default">When righteousness demands it,<br/>he'll destroy a hundred men.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:03:54.666"
        end="00:03:58.125"><span region="Default">But he won't harm even an ant<br/>needlessly, ma'am.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:03:58.833"
        end="00:04:00.833"><span region="Default">Whatever you say, Perumal,<br/>a criminal is still a criminal.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:04:01.125"
        end="00:04:04.791"><span region="Default">-You need to take action.<br/>-Sorry, ma'am. I cannot.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:04:08.625"
        end="00:04:10.166"><span region="Default">I'll submit my resignation.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:04:11.416"
        end="00:04:12.375"><span region="Default">Krishnamacharya…</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:04:13.708"
        end="00:04:15.250"><span region="Default">Chaturvedi… Sorry!</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:04:15.625"
        end="00:04:18.500"><span region="Default">I know what I'm saying<br/>and why I'm saying it.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:04:19.083"
        end="00:04:20.875"><span region="Default">-Thank you.<br/>-You may stop if you wish.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:04:20.958"
        end="00:04:21.875"><span region="Default">We won't.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:04:22.541"
        end="00:04:23.500"><span region="Default">Impossible!</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:04:25.000"
        end="00:04:27.291"><span region="Default">You can't stop him, ma'am.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:04:28.416"
        end="00:04:30.958"><span region="Default">He is nature's own wrath.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:04:31.708"
        end="00:04:35.375"><span region="Default">A weapon forged by God himself<br/>for his divine purpose.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:04:37.125"
        end="00:04:40.500"><span region="Default">Don't try to cage lightning<br/>in your palm, ma'am.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:04:42.250"
        end="00:04:44.958"><span region="Default">When the divine reveals himself,<br/>we bow in reverence…</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:04:45.958"
        end="00:04:46.875"><span region="Default">not pass judgment.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:04:47.250"
        end="00:04:50.541"><span region="Default">You speak as if he's a god.<br/>Where is he now?</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:06:15.625"
        end="00:06:16.500"><span region="Default">Akhanda…</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:06:20.916"
        end="00:06:22.083"><span region="Default">Victory be upon you.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:06:22.833"
        end="00:06:27.583"><span region="Default">As a child, you came into our arms<br/>under the grace of the Supreme.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:06:31.333"
        end="00:06:35.083"><span region="Default">You conquered the six vices of man<br/>and attained the power of Aghora.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:06:36.500"
        end="00:06:41.416"><span region="Default">You breathed life into decaying temples</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:06:41.750"
        end="00:06:46.791"><span region="Default">and now, into this fading society.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:06:47.833"
        end="00:06:51.041"><span region="Default">-It is the will of the Lord.<br/>-But time won't stop there, son.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:06:51.125"
        end="00:06:56.958"><span region="Default">Fate will test you<br/>harder than ever before.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:06:59.625"
        end="00:07:01.708"><span region="Default">You must transcend yourself<br/>as the answer to that test.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:07:01.958"
        end="00:07:04.958"><span region="Default">The only path ahead<br/>is the mastery of</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:07:05.041"
        end="00:07:07.291"><span region="Default">the Eight Divine Powers.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:07:09.041"
        end="00:07:10.916"><span region="Default">This is the sacred seat,<br/>where Arjuna once prayed to Lord Shiva</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:07:11.458"
        end="00:07:16.125"><span region="Default">for the Pashupathastram, to restore dharma</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:07:16.208"
        end="00:07:21.083"><span region="Default">and change the fate of the Dwaparayuga…</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:07:21.250"
        end="00:07:23.208"><span region="Default">the Ashtalinga Rudra Peetham.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:07:31.666"
        end="00:07:34.666"><span region="Default">By Lord Shiva's grace,<br/>the day you attain this power…</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:07:34.750"
        end="00:07:38.458"><span region="Default">Every mantra and scripture,</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:07:38.750"
        end="00:07:42.625"><span region="Default">every weapon, and formation<br/>shall bend to your command.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:07:43.333"
        end="00:07:46.958"><span region="Default">With every step you take,<br/>they will move beside you.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:07:48.000"
        end="00:07:50.583"><span region="Default">But the path ahead is perilous.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:07:51.458"
        end="00:07:53.041"><span region="Default">Each seal<br/>must be performed in perfection.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:07:53.125"
        end="00:07:57.666"><span region="Default">One misstep…<br/>and even your life is forfeited.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:09:25.916"
        end="00:09:31.500"><span region="Default">-Salutations to Lord Shiva!<br/>-Salutations to Lord Shiva!</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:09:31.666"
        end="00:09:33.666"><span region="Default">Salutations to Lord Shiva!</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:12:57.958"
        end="00:13:01.250"><span region="Default">-General, we're ready.<br/>-Bloodbath.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:13:40.375"
        end="00:13:43.208"><span region="Default">Swami, did you see this carnage?<br/>They wiped everyone out, Swami!</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:13:47.166"
        end="00:13:51.416"><span region="Default">You made a mistake,<br/>and your village stood by you.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:13:52.291"
        end="00:13:54.958"><span region="Default">You wrote to my country<br/>that living under my tyranny is difficult</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:13:55.083"
        end="00:13:58.750"><span region="Default">and asked to have me removed.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:14:00.541"
        end="00:14:01.416"><span region="Default">No mistake there.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:14:02.958"
        end="00:14:05.125"><span region="Default">You even mocked my family,</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:14:05.541"
        end="00:14:08.875"><span region="Default">the ones guarding this border<br/>for a century.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:14:10.000"
        end="00:14:11.208"><span region="Default">It's a bit painful.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:14:12.500"
        end="00:14:13.666"><span region="Default">But I endured it.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:14:14.583"
        end="00:14:17.500"><span region="Default">Then you wrote again<br/>that if I'm not dismissed…</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:14:17.625"
        end="00:14:20.750"><span region="Default">you'd side with the enemy nation.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:14:21.083"
        end="00:14:23.166"><span region="Default">That hurt my feelings.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:14:24.250"
        end="00:14:25.375"><span region="Default">Unbearable!</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:14:29.166"
        end="00:14:31.250"><span region="Default">Now go join India.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:14:32.916"
        end="00:14:37.791"><span region="Default">Your Buddha's teachings<br/>can't match the power of my bullet.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:14:39.291"
        end="00:14:43.208"><span region="Default">People bow before you,<br/>hanging on your every word.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:14:43.583"
        end="00:14:47.000"><span region="Default">Tell them,<br/>"Death has come for your village."</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:14:47.333"
        end="00:14:49.833"><span region="Default">Tell them it looks just like me.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:14:52.500"
        end="00:14:58.625"><span region="Default">Wherever the name "India" is spoken,<br/>tell them this death will follow.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:14:59.541"
        end="00:15:01.833"><span region="Default">Tell that to your god as well.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:15:13.041"
        end="00:15:14.791"><span region="Default">General, we have a serious situation.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:15:50.916"
        end="00:15:51.916"><span region="Default">Excuse me, sir.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:16:16.208"
        end="00:16:19.791"><span region="Default">My son, you've been posted to Galwan.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:16:22.500"
        end="00:16:25.750"><span region="Default">-Live like a ruler, die with honor.<br/>-Yes, sir.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:16:27.833"
        end="00:16:30.166"><span region="Default">General, your son was a brave soldier.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:16:30.250"
        end="00:16:34.125"><span region="Default">-How many did my son kill before falling?<br/>-Sorry, sir.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:16:34.375"
        end="00:16:37.708"><span region="Default">Just one punch from an Indian soldier<br/>brought him down.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:16:39.125"
        end="00:16:41.041"><span region="Default">-You can't come here.<br/>-We'll come anywhere.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:16:47.375"
        end="00:16:51.500"><span region="Default">For a hundred years,<br/>my family has guarded these borders.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:16:51.583"
        end="00:16:55.541"><span region="Default">And yet…<br/>that nation left me without an heir.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:16:57.000"
        end="00:16:59.208"><span region="Default">My son's death won't be wasted.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:16:59.666"
        end="00:17:01.250"><span region="Default">I will answer it.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:17:02.625"
        end="00:17:04.916"><span region="Default">Sir, shall we ship the bodies<br/>to Headquarters?</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:17:06.041"
        end="00:17:08.375"><span region="Default">Everybody should hear of my victories…</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:17:08.541"
        end="00:17:11.916"><span region="Default">-not my defeat.<br/>-Hail Mother India!</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:17:12.000"
        end="00:17:15.875"><span region="Default">-Hail Mother India!<br/>-Hail Mother India!</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:17:15.958"
        end="00:17:19.958"><span region="Default">-Hail Mother India!<br/>-Hail Mother India!</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:17:20.041"
        end="00:17:23.916"><span region="Default">-Hail Mother India!<br/>-Hail Mother India!</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:17:24.250"
        end="00:17:28.166"><span region="Default">Their flag is smiling.<br/>We should make it cry.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:17:28.250"
        end="00:17:29.125"><span region="Default">-Sir?<br/>-Hail Mother India…</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:17:30.583"
        end="00:17:33.750"><span region="Default">Their flag laughs in our faces.<br/>We should make it weep!</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:17:33.833"
        end="00:17:36.708"><span region="Default">To make that possible,<br/>we must meet ex-General Chang,</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:17:37.041"
        end="00:17:41.208"><span region="Default">who faced defeat before that nation<br/>and has been waiting for its destruction.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:17:41.375"
        end="00:17:43.333"><span region="Default">But our government won't agree.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:17:44.416"
        end="00:17:49.625"><span region="Default">Let the government rule. I will wage war.<br/>Where is Chang?</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:18:13.333"
        end="00:18:16.500"><span region="Default">-Sir!<br/>-Where is Chang? I need to see him.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:19:07.541"
        end="00:19:12.791"><span region="Default">I'm here to teach a lesson<br/>to the nation that killed my son…</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:19:13.083"
        end="00:19:14.916"><span region="Default">and you're reciting the Bhagavad Gita?</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:19:15.333"
        end="00:19:16.250"><span region="Default">General.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:19:17.708"
        end="00:19:22.833"><span region="Default">To strike India,<br/>you don't just hit a corner.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:19:25.083"
        end="00:19:29.708"><span region="Default">You go deep, into its roots.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:19:30.333"
        end="00:19:33.875"><span region="Default">Twenty-five years…<br/>that's what I've been searching for.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:19:34.000"
        end="00:19:35.041"><span region="Default">Where are those roots?</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:19:36.041"
        end="00:19:37.083"><span region="Default">Once…</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:19:38.583"
        end="00:19:41.791"><span region="Default">the nation that was Akhanda Bharat…</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:19:43.541"
        end="00:19:48.083"><span region="Default">even Alexander, the world conqueror,<br/>could not break it.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:19:48.625"
        end="00:19:52.500"><span region="Default">He left with nothing<br/>but a handful of soil.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:19:53.916"
        end="00:19:59.125"><span region="Default">Not even a force like Genghis Khan,<br/>who shook our nation to its core,</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:20:00.041"
        end="00:20:02.625"><span region="Default">could set foot on its soil.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:20:03.375"
        end="00:20:04.666"><span region="Default">What's their courage?</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:20:06.500"
        end="00:20:10.750"><span region="Default">The Turkish and the British…</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:20:11.708"
        end="00:20:16.708"><span region="Default">who stepped in through deceit,<br/>and the help of traitors…</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:20:17.916"
        end="00:20:20.125"><span region="Default">ruled for over a thousand years.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:20:21.791"
        end="00:20:23.083"><span region="Default">As long as they were here,</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:20:23.833"
        end="00:20:26.583"><span region="Default">when people read the Vedas,<br/>they cut out their tongues.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:20:27.500"
        end="00:20:29.708"><span region="Default">If they listened,<br/>they poured molten lead in their ears.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:20:30.583"
        end="00:20:33.625"><span region="Default">If they worshipped God,<br/>they cut off their heads.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:20:35.333"
        end="00:20:39.833"><span region="Default">They destroyed temples, smashed idols,<br/>and plundered everything they found.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:20:43.041"
        end="00:20:45.291"><span region="Default">Despite countless blows,</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:20:45.958"
        end="00:20:47.958"><span region="Default">without losing its essence,</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:20:48.500"
        end="00:20:52.625"><span region="Default">this nation still stands before the world<br/>with its eyes wide open.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:20:53.958"
        end="00:20:55.125"><span region="Default">What's that courage?</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:20:56.083"
        end="00:20:59.916"><span region="Default">That courage is…<br/>the god they believed in.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:21:08.375"
        end="00:21:10.125"><span region="Default">-God?<br/>-Yes.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:21:11.166"
        end="00:21:14.625"><span region="Default">Indians believe in God so much that</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:21:15.833"
        end="00:21:18.166"><span region="Default">as soon as a child is born,<br/>they cut the cord with the mother</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:21:18.666"
        end="00:21:19.875"><span region="Default">and tie it to God.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:21:20.250"
        end="00:21:21.750"><span region="Default">They name the child after God.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:21:22.291"
        end="00:21:24.166"><span region="Default">They say, "God is with you."</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:21:24.291"
        end="00:21:26.375"><span region="Default">When they grow up, it's God's mercy.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:21:27.541"
        end="00:21:30.041"><span region="Default">When they die, it's God taking them.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:21:30.958"
        end="00:21:34.791"><span region="Default">The joy they feel is from God,<br/>and even their pain comes from God.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:21:36.083"
        end="00:21:39.416"><span region="Default">That's why…<br/>Indians have immense courage.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:21:40.416"
        end="00:21:44.083"><span region="Default">The courage that comes from knowing<br/>God is always behind them.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:21:44.166"
        end="00:21:45.500"><span region="Default">What must be done now?</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:21:45.875"
        end="00:21:47.916"><span region="Default">That courage must be broken.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:21:48.958"
        end="00:21:52.291"><span region="Default">The God in their hearts<br/>must be struck down.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:21:58.458"
        end="00:22:01.208"><span region="Default">The people who believe that God will come<br/>to their rescue in times of trouble,</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:22:02.000"
        end="00:22:05.333"><span region="Default">we must make them believe He won't.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:22:06.458"
        end="00:22:07.916"><span region="Default">The day they believe that,</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:22:08.125"
        end="00:22:11.083"><span region="Default">India… will break into pieces.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:22:11.541"
        end="00:22:14.333"><span region="Default">Now tell me, how do we strike that God?</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:22:15.125"
        end="00:22:18.083"><span region="Default">Go, bring it.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:22:19.000"
        end="00:22:23.916"><span region="Default">The weapon I created<br/>to destroy that nation</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:22:24.791"
        end="00:22:27.666"><span region="Default">was hidden by our own country out of fear.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:22:29.250"
        end="00:22:31.666"><span region="Default">If you bring that weapon,</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:22:32.125"
        end="00:22:35.833"><span region="Default">I will show you how to strike<br/>their courage and their God.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:22:56.291"
        end="00:22:58.250"><span region="Default">TRUTH ALWAYS TRIUMPHS</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:22:58.333"
        end="00:23:01.375"><span region="Default">Sir, this is a clear report<br/>of the conflict between</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:23:01.458"
        end="00:23:02.708"><span region="Default">the armies of the two nations<br/>near the valley.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:23:03.500"
        end="00:23:06.333"><span region="Default">Our forces gave them a strong response.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:23:07.166"
        end="00:23:11.000"><span region="Default">But the problem is… among those killed,</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:23:11.416"
        end="00:23:13.625"><span region="Default">there's General Zhang Li's son as well.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:23:14.958"
        end="00:23:18.833"><span region="Default">Sir, he is the most ruthless<br/>and dangerous person I've ever seen.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:23:19.166"
        end="00:23:22.625"><span region="Default">Now that his son is dead,<br/>imagine how vengeful he will become.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:23:22.916"
        end="00:23:29.250"><span region="Default">In the world, our army<br/>is the most systematic and ethical.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:23:30.250"
        end="00:23:33.666"><span region="Default">Whatever they do,<br/>it's for the nation's welfare.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:23:34.208"
        end="00:23:37.208"><span region="Default">We are giving them complete freedom.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:23:37.708"
        end="00:23:40.416"><span region="Default">Just make the right decision<br/>at the right time.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:23:40.750"
        end="00:23:41.666"><span region="Default">-Yes, sir.<br/>-Yes, sir.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:23:43.458"
        end="00:23:45.875"><span region="Default">-Sir, please have a look at this report.<br/>-Sir…</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:23:47.083"
        end="00:23:49.416"><span region="Default">You will have a press meet<br/>for the rural development program.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:23:49.708"
        end="00:23:52.666"><span region="Default">Do not comment on this incident. Please.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:23:59.375"
        end="00:24:02.375"><span region="Default">Hello. I am Vishal Trivedhi,<br/>the Collector of Kadapa.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:24:06.500"
        end="00:24:08.708"><span region="Default">Yes, sir. Please come, sir.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:24:10.333"
        end="00:24:12.083"><span region="Default">-Mr. Trivedhi.<br/>-Yes.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:24:12.166"
        end="00:24:14.166"><span region="Default">In an hour,<br/>after the PM sir's press meet,</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:24:14.250"
        end="00:24:15.875"><span region="Default">Padmavati ma'am will meet you.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:24:16.000"
        end="00:24:17.916"><span region="Default">-Please come.<br/>-I have a correction for the press meet.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:24:18.000"
        end="00:24:20.333"><span region="Default">-What?<br/>-Please. It's very urgent.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:24:21.250"
        end="00:24:23.166"><span region="Default">Ma'am, Trivedhi is here.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:24:23.291"
        end="00:24:25.875"><span region="Default">He urgently wants to meet you<br/>before the press meet.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:24:30.708"
        end="00:24:33.333"><span region="Default">Yes, Mr. Trivedhi.<br/>You said it's urgent.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:24:33.583"
        end="00:24:34.458"><span region="Default">Tell me what it is.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:24:34.583"
        end="00:24:36.708"><span region="Default">Ma'am, from the list<br/>you're about to announce,</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:24:36.791"
        end="00:24:39.333"><span region="Default">I've come to request<br/>the removal of Shantipuram.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:24:42.083"
        end="00:24:42.958"><span region="Default">What?</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:24:44.916"
        end="00:24:48.125"><span region="Default">If that village is included<br/>in the PM Rural Development Program,</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:24:48.791"
        end="00:24:52.041"><span region="Default">it'll attract two international schools,<br/>two medical campuses,</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:24:52.791"
        end="00:24:54.833"><span region="Default">and significant developmental investment.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:24:55.375"
        end="00:24:57.625"><span region="Default">The fate of that area<br/>will change overnight.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:24:58.583"
        end="00:24:59.541"><span region="Default">Why should it be removed?</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:24:59.625"
        end="00:25:01.833"><span region="Default">If that name is announced,<br/>many lives will be lost, ma'am.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:25:04.333"
        end="00:25:05.208"><span region="Default">What's the problem?</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:25:05.375"
        end="00:25:07.208"><span region="Default">As soon as you mention that name,</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:25:07.291"
        end="00:25:10.708"><span region="Default">the best of the district's officers<br/>will be sent for an area survey.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:25:11.458"
        end="00:25:13.458"><span region="Default">As soon as the officers get there,<br/>they will find out…</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:25:14.375"
        end="00:25:17.291"><span region="Default">that it's not a village<br/>but a deadly drug dump yard.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:25:20.500"
        end="00:25:22.375"><span region="Default">Weed cultivation across hundreds of acres.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:25:23.666"
        end="00:25:27.125"><span region="Default">Hundreds of poor men<br/>risk their lives working there.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:25:30.291"
        end="00:25:31.958"><span region="Default">-Students enslaved by it.<br/>-No.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:25:32.625"
        end="00:25:33.916"><span region="Default">A cruel private</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:25:34.000"
        end="00:25:36.166"><span region="Default">Tamil Nadu gang protects it.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:25:36.250"
        end="00:25:37.291"><span region="Default">This whole operation</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:25:37.416"
        end="00:25:38.500"><span region="Default">is run by ex-MLA Maddireddy.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:25:38.583"
        end="00:25:40.458"><span region="Default">Cut him into pieces<br/>and feed him to the dogs.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:25:40.583"
        end="00:25:43.583"><span region="Default">All this is being funded<br/>by Choudappa Goud from Karnataka.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:25:43.958"
        end="00:25:45.083"><span region="Default">It's money.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:25:45.166"
        end="00:25:49.625"><span region="Default">The Mumbai mafia runs this entire network<br/>and distributes drugs across the country.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:25:51.625"
        end="00:25:54.333"><span region="Default">They beat our officers<br/>who saw all this and left them to die.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:25:55.625"
        end="00:25:59.125"><span region="Default">If this came out,<br/>or if the government interfered,</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:25:59.708"
        end="00:26:02.416"><span region="Default">they'd kill our officers<br/>and send their bodies back.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:26:02.708"
        end="00:26:04.625"><span region="Default">You should've sought<br/>the district SP's support.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:26:04.791"
        end="00:26:06.333"><span region="Default">The SP was also part of the team, sir.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:26:08.000"
        end="00:26:10.958"><span region="Default">Ma'am, the government<br/>can handle such things.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:26:11.166"
        end="00:26:14.500"><span region="Default">But it's a time-consuming process.<br/>It's better if we remove the name.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:26:17.875"
        end="00:26:20.791"><span region="Default">Besides, he says, many officers<br/>could lose their lives.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:26:20.916"
        end="00:26:21.916"><span region="Default">It's risky, ma'am.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:26:27.375"
        end="00:26:29.458"><span region="Default">-How much longer until the press meet?<br/>-One hour, ma'am.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:26:30.291"
        end="00:26:31.208"><span region="Default">That's enough.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:26:32.666"
        end="00:26:33.916"><span region="Default">Who are you calling, ma'am?</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:26:34.541"
        end="00:26:37.250"><span region="Default">Someone who can clear<br/>this problem in an hour.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:26:37.958"
        end="00:26:40.083"><span region="Default">One person? Where is he?</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:26:46.375"
        end="00:26:52.000"><span region="Default">Oh, Demon King<br/>You don't have to doubt his existence</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:26:53.541"
        end="00:26:56.750"><span region="Default">Lord Vishnu is omnipresent</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:26:56.833"
        end="00:27:02.916"><span region="Default">You name any place, he is seen</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:27:03.000"
        end="00:27:06.958"><span region="Default">Even the demons get frightened<br/>When they hear about Chakri's presence</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:27:07.041"
        end="00:27:07.916"><span region="Default">Hey!</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:27:08.000"
        end="00:27:09.666"><span region="Default">Is your Lord Vishnu that capable?</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:27:09.833"
        end="00:27:13.250"><span region="Default">Yes, three times unbeatable, unstoppable.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:27:13.416"
        end="00:27:14.625"><span region="Default">The one and only.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:27:14.875"
        end="00:27:16.250"><span region="Default">Oh! Is that so?</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:27:16.500"
        end="00:27:19.041"><span region="Default">Is he present in this?<br/>Or in this? Maybe in this?</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:27:19.166"
        end="00:27:22.833"><span region="Default">-He's present everywhere, Father.<br/>-Then, ask him to come out of this pillar.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:27:41.750"
        end="00:27:42.666"><span region="Default">Who is it?</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:29:14.125"
        end="00:29:15.083"><span region="Default">Hey!</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:29:17.291"
        end="00:29:19.041"><span region="Default">Watch your tone!</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:29:19.541"
        end="00:29:23.208"><span region="Default">Even I don't know which sound will<br/>make me laugh or make me snap!</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:29:23.541"
        end="00:29:24.875"><span region="Default">It's beyond your imagination!</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:29:56.500"
        end="00:29:58.666"><span region="Default">You've crossed the line.<br/>You're miscalculating!</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:29:59.333"
        end="00:30:01.750"><span region="Default">You think I'm some layout guy<br/>to calculate numbers?</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:30:02.500"
        end="00:30:03.458"><span region="Default">Blow out!</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:30:07.583"
        end="00:30:11.041"><span region="Default">-I'll crush you, moron!<br/>-What business is it of yours?</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:30:11.125"
        end="00:30:12.875"><span region="Default">If this territory suffers,<br/>I'll nurture it.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:30:13.541"
        end="00:30:15.458"><span region="Default">If this territory faces danger,<br/>I'll take necessary action.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:30:15.958"
        end="00:30:18.083"><span region="Default">If someone makes a mistake here,<br/>I'll deal with it.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:30:18.500"
        end="00:30:20.541"><span region="Default">Frontline soldier!</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:30:33.000"
        end="00:30:35.583"><span region="Default">Kadapa, Kurnool, Chittoor, Anantapur…</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:30:36.166"
        end="00:30:39.333"><span region="Default">Every house here is mine.<br/>Every family in Rayalaseema is my family.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:30:39.958"
        end="00:30:43.041"><span region="Default">If they face any injustice,<br/>I will not stand and watch.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:30:44.083"
        end="00:30:47.166"><span region="Default">Hey! He is Bala Murali Krishna,<br/>MLA, right?</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:30:47.250"
        end="00:30:49.625"><span region="Default">He's here for the officers.<br/>Tear them apart.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:30:53.291"
        end="00:30:54.250"><span region="Default">Hey!</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:31:44.000"
        end="00:31:47.208"><span region="Default">Hey, Bala Murali. I am also an ex-MLA.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:31:47.458"
        end="00:31:49.666"><span region="Default">You're acting arrogantly because<br/>your government is in power!</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:31:50.125"
        end="00:31:51.125"><span region="Default">I'll show you!</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:31:51.208"
        end="00:31:54.000"><span region="Default">When asked what he was up to,<br/>some idiot like you once said</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:31:54.291"
        end="00:31:57.791"><span region="Default">that he'd written the number 13<br/>and gone to sleep.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:31:58.666"
        end="00:32:00.750"><span region="Default">For someone who works,<br/>power and positions don't matter.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:32:01.166"
        end="00:32:03.083"><span region="Default">My power is on 24/7.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:32:03.166"
        end="00:32:04.083"><span region="Default">Hey!</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:32:05.000"
        end="00:32:06.458"><span region="Default">I am a Kannadiga, man.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:32:06.916"
        end="00:32:08.208"><span region="Default">I'll see your end.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:32:08.291"
        end="00:32:09.875"><span region="Default">Karnataka is my brother's home.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:32:10.458"
        end="00:32:14.083"><span region="Default">Wherever you are,<br/>whatever you do, always stay a Kannadiga.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:32:14.625"
        end="00:32:16.541"><span region="Default">Kannada is true, Kannada is eternal!</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:32:16.875"
        end="00:32:18.750"><span region="Default">Haven't you heard<br/>Poet Kuvempu say this before?</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:32:19.458"
        end="00:32:22.083"><span region="Default">Krishnadevaraya, the warrior!</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:32:22.458"
        end="00:32:25.208"><span region="Default">Kanteerava Rajkumar, the brave!</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:32:25.875"
        end="00:32:28.875"><span region="Default">You don't deserve to call yourself<br/>a Kannadiga after your actions!</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:32:29.000"
        end="00:32:30.166"><span region="Default">-Go!<br/>-Hey!</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:32:30.291"
        end="00:32:32.375"><span region="Default">Who are you trying to hit?<br/>Do you know who I am?</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:32:32.458"
        end="00:32:34.625"><span region="Default">-I'll kill you.<br/>-Yeah! Kill me! Kill me!</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:32:34.708"
        end="00:32:35.958"><span region="Default">I am standing right here.<br/>Kill me! Come on!</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:32:39.291"
        end="00:32:41.125"><span region="Default">To think so highly of yourself,</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:32:41.583"
        end="00:32:44.750"><span region="Default">who are you, the savior, MGR?</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:32:45.041"
        end="00:32:47.916"><span region="Default">Or the great soul, NTR?!</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:32:48.083"
        end="00:32:51.500"><span region="Default">You're nothing special.<br/>So, shut up!</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:32:51.958"
        end="00:32:54.750"><span region="Default">I'll kill you! Right on the spot!</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:32:55.125"
        end="00:32:56.375"><span region="Default">-Get lost!<br/>-Hey!</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:32:56.541"
        end="00:32:58.625"><span region="Default">Don't you know<br/>about the Mumbai mafia?</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:32:58.708"
        end="00:32:59.583"><span region="Default">Shut up!</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:33:00.250"
        end="00:33:03.750"><span region="Default">I know more about Mumbai<br/>and Maharashtra than your father does.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:33:04.416"
        end="00:33:07.958"><span region="Default">Maharashtra means<br/>the empire of Chhatrapati Shivaji Maharaj.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:33:08.166"
        end="00:33:10.083"><span region="Default">It's not a place for thieves like you.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:33:10.500"
        end="00:33:12.833"><span region="Default">Mumbai is where the saffron soars.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:33:13.083"
        end="00:33:15.291"><span region="Default">It's not a hangout spot<br/>for scoundrels like you.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:33:16.333"
        end="00:33:19.583"><span region="Default">Mumbai means mother.<br/>It is India's heartbeat.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:33:20.000"
        end="00:33:23.583"><span region="Default">It is the greatest.<br/>It's the pride of this nation.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:33:24.458"
        end="00:33:27.333"><span region="Default">Students who study should have a pen<br/>in their pocket and a book in their hands.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:33:27.416"
        end="00:33:28.708"><span region="Default">Their minds should be filled<br/>with knowledge.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:33:29.125"
        end="00:33:31.208"><span region="Default">Why do they have weed with them?</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:33:32.583"
        end="00:33:36.041"><span region="Default">Setting up counters in college canteens<br/>and luring the youth into intoxication,</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:33:36.250"
        end="00:33:38.083"><span region="Default">what does it bring…<br/>development or destruction?</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:33:40.375"
        end="00:33:42.375"><span region="Default">At this age, when one<br/>should be supporting their family,</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:33:42.875"
        end="00:33:45.500"><span region="Default">if fresh young blood falls prey to drugs,</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:33:45.958"
        end="00:33:48.916"><span region="Default">do you know how shattered<br/>the hearts of those parents would be?</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:33:50.333"
        end="00:33:54.500"><span region="Default">Addiction drives them to crime, blind<br/>to whose mother or sister they're hurting!</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:33:54.875"
        end="00:33:57.125"><span region="Default">With no escape and no livelihood,</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:33:57.291"
        end="00:33:59.125"><span region="Default">how many girls<br/>are left to sell their dignity?</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:33:59.541"
        end="00:34:01.708"><span region="Default">How many lives are lost<br/>in the name of honor?</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:34:04.833"
        end="00:34:08.041"><span region="Default">Even chocolates and ice creams<br/>eaten by small kids near schools</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:34:08.125"
        end="00:34:09.208"><span region="Default">are laced with weed.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:34:09.583"
        end="00:34:12.250"><span region="Default">Does eating them<br/>bring knowledge or destruction?</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:34:15.000"
        end="00:34:16.666"><span region="Default">Governments are risking lives,</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:34:16.750"
        end="00:34:19.583"><span region="Default">trying to stop this intoxicating drug<br/>and protect the youth,</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:34:20.250"
        end="00:34:21.583"><span region="Default">and you dare oppose it?</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:34:23.416"
        end="00:34:27.625"><span region="Default">This land has suffered through tears,<br/>hardship, blood, and war.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:34:27.708"
        end="00:34:30.000"><span region="Default">That's enough!</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:34:30.083"
        end="00:34:32.000"><span region="Default">Now, all that remains is development.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:34:33.083"
        end="00:34:35.208"><span region="Default">Anyone who stands in its way,</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:34:35.750"
        end="00:34:37.791"><span region="Default">I will tear them apart<br/>and crush them under my feet.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:36:02.833"
        end="00:36:04.791"><span region="Default">Brother-in-law, the Collector has arrived.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:36:20.458"
        end="00:36:21.333"><span region="Default">Thank you, sir.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:36:22.083"
        end="00:36:23.166"><span region="Default">You are a police officer.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:36:24.041"
        end="00:36:26.458"><span region="Default">You've dealt with<br/>many of society's problems.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:36:27.125"
        end="00:36:30.125"><span region="Default">If you strike together,<br/>any problem can be solved.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:36:30.708"
        end="00:36:33.541"><span region="Default">Even if it's weed-fueled intoxication,<br/>or arrogant morons.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:36:33.875"
        end="00:36:35.083"><span region="Default">Don't spare!</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:36:36.708"
        end="00:36:38.625"><span region="Default">-Come, let's eat.<br/>-Oh! Never mind, sir.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:36:39.500"
        end="00:36:41.291"><span region="Default">Come, Collector sir. Come.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:37:20.291"
        end="00:37:21.916"><span region="Default">I know what you've done.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:37:22.666"
        end="00:37:26.000"><span region="Default">If this were possible today,<br/>it's because of you.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:37:29.500"
        end="00:37:31.500"><span region="Default">This is not the recognition meant for you.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:37:31.833"
        end="00:37:33.583"><span region="Default">It's the respect you truly deserve.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:37:34.291"
        end="00:37:35.708"><span region="Default">Please, break it!</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:37:47.833"
        end="00:37:48.916"><span region="Default">Sorry, Mr. Murali.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:37:49.375"
        end="00:37:52.583"><span region="Default">I was planning to have lunch<br/>with you after this program.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:37:52.791"
        end="00:37:56.208"><span region="Default">But there's an unexpected<br/>disturbance in Manipur.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:37:56.583"
        end="00:37:57.708"><span region="Default">I need to leave urgently.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:37:58.000"
        end="00:38:00.666"><span region="Default">-We'll meet in Delhi then.<br/>-Sure, sir.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:38:00.875"
        end="00:38:02.333"><span region="Default">What about your kids?</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:38:02.458"
        end="00:38:05.625"><span region="Default">A 17-year-old daughter.<br/>Scientist at DRDO.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:38:05.875"
        end="00:38:07.666"><span region="Default">-What?<br/>-Yes, sir.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:38:07.833"
        end="00:38:10.708"><span region="Default">She's a child prodigy.<br/>Her IQ is 226.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:38:11.000"
        end="00:38:12.333"><span region="Default">She's the top student in India.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:38:13.458"
        end="00:38:16.958"><span region="Default">Selected as the topper<br/>for DRDO's Vision Kalam project.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:38:17.541"
        end="00:38:19.416"><span region="Default">And that too, by your hands.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:38:20.916"
        end="00:38:24.458"><span region="Default">Oh! That girl? Where is her posting?</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:38:37.416"
        end="00:38:38.666"><span region="Default">-Hello, sir.<br/>-Good morning.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:38:38.833"
        end="00:38:40.833"><span region="Default">Sir, you're here suddenly?</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:38:40.916"
        end="00:38:43.041"><span region="Default">Where is Archana Goswami?</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:38:54.708"
        end="00:38:56.541"><span region="Default">Sir, how are you? A sudden surprise.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:38:56.625"
        end="00:38:57.750"><span region="Default">-I'm fine.<br/>-Nice.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:38:58.000"
        end="00:39:01.500"><span region="Default">After seeing the details<br/>of the bio-shield project you submitted,</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:39:01.750"
        end="00:39:03.375"><span region="Default">the PM was very impressed.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:39:03.458"
        end="00:39:06.166"><span region="Default">-Wow.<br/>-He personally asked me to address it.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:39:06.250"
        end="00:39:09.291"><span region="Default">-Okay.<br/>-I came here to understand the details.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:39:09.458"
        end="00:39:10.375"><span region="Default">Sure, sir.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:39:11.750"
        end="00:39:14.750"><span region="Default">Sir, our military<br/>in the northern Himachal region</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:39:15.750"
        end="00:39:19.375"><span region="Default">has to operate in Siachen<br/>at -50 to -60 degrees.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:39:19.750"
        end="00:39:22.000"><span region="Default">Rajasthan is the complete opposite.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:39:22.333"
        end="00:39:26.208"><span region="Default">They must work in 50 to 60-degree<br/>heat under the sun.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:39:26.750"
        end="00:39:30.083"><span region="Default">Eastern Ghats…<br/>It's all marshy land there.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:39:30.666"
        end="00:39:33.458"><span region="Default">Even there,<br/>they must always be ready for war.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:39:33.625"
        end="00:39:36.416"><span region="Default">Coastal areas…<br/>surrounded by the sea on three sides!</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:39:36.500"
        end="00:39:39.166"><span region="Default">So, our army loses more men to nature</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:39:39.250"
        end="00:39:42.666"><span region="Default">than bullets from enemies, sir,<br/>and we need to break it.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:39:42.833"
        end="00:39:45.041"><span region="Default">For that, we need a one-shot solution.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:39:45.625"
        end="00:39:47.791"><span region="Default">That's why<br/>I developed this bio-shield, sir.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:39:47.958"
        end="00:39:50.791"><span region="Default">Except for human trials,<br/>the entire process is complete.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:39:51.000"
        end="00:39:52.208"><span region="Default">And sir, by the way,</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:39:52.458"
        end="00:39:54.916"><span region="Default">I personally monitored and submitted this.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:39:55.041"
        end="00:39:58.666"><span region="Default">But the entire design, thought,<br/>and implementation</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:39:58.833"
        end="00:40:00.625"><span region="Default">were done with Janani<br/>and her team's support,</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:40:00.708"
        end="00:40:02.208"><span region="Default">who got selected<br/>under the Vision Kalam program, sir.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:40:02.291"
        end="00:40:03.375"><span region="Default">They made it possible.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:40:04.041"
        end="00:40:06.000"><span region="Default">Janani? Where is she?</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:40:27.041"
        end="00:40:29.208"><span region="Default">Hi, Janani. This is Mr. Rao,</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:40:29.333"
        end="00:40:31.666"><span region="Default">our Defense Minister.<br/>He wanted to meet you once.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:40:31.958"
        end="00:40:33.833"><span region="Default">-Hello, sir.<br/>-Hi, dear.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:40:34.208"
        end="00:40:35.375"><span region="Default">I want to know something.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:40:35.875"
        end="00:40:40.958"><span region="Default">At such a young age,<br/>how did you come up with a solution</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:40:41.250"
        end="00:40:42.500"><span region="Default">to such a difficult problem?</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:40:42.708"
        end="00:40:44.000"><span region="Default">From the Ramayana, sir.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:40:46.541"
        end="00:40:48.625"><span region="Default">-From the Ramayana?<br/>-Yes, sir.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:40:48.958"
        end="00:40:51.750"><span region="Default">To protect his yajna,<br/>Sage Vishwamitra</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:40:51.833"
        end="00:40:53.791"><span region="Default">taught Rama and Lakshmana</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:40:54.000"
        end="00:40:56.291"><span region="Default">two powerful practices,<br/>"Bala" and "Atibala."</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:40:56.375"
        end="00:40:58.250"><span region="Default">That's what inspired my project.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:40:58.416"
        end="00:41:00.458"><span region="Default">That strength, sir,<br/>that was what empowered Lord Rama.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:41:00.541"
        end="00:41:02.291"><span region="Default">From Ayodhya all the way to Lanka,</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:41:02.416"
        end="00:41:08.250"><span region="Default">through forests, mountains, and rivers,<br/>and even across the mighty ocean,</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:41:08.375"
        end="00:41:11.791"><span region="Default">he fought his war without nature<br/>ever standing in his way.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:41:13.416"
        end="00:41:16.333"><span region="Default">So, you mean to make every soldier…<br/>a Rama himself.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:41:16.958"
        end="00:41:17.833"><span region="Default">Very good.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:41:18.333"
        end="00:41:19.583"><span region="Default">-Archana.<br/>-Yes, sir.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:41:19.708"
        end="00:41:22.000"><span region="Default">You'd requested permission<br/>for human trials, right?</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:41:22.083"
        end="00:41:23.666"><span region="Default">-Yes, sir.<br/>-That will be arranged.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:41:23.833"
        end="00:41:24.750"><span region="Default">Thank you so much, sir.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:41:25.250"
        end="00:41:26.541"><span region="Default">If you guys succeed,</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:41:27.041"
        end="00:41:29.041"><span region="Default">the very strength of the Indian Army<br/>will be redefined.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:41:29.625"
        end="00:41:33.333"><span region="Default">You'll be remembered forever<br/>in the hearts of our soldiers.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:41:34.000"
        end="00:41:36.583"><span region="Default">The whole world will turn<br/>and look toward us.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:41:37.875"
        end="00:41:39.708"><span region="Default">-Best of luck, Janani.<br/>-Thank you, sir.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:41:39.791"
        end="00:41:40.666"><span region="Default">All the best, guys!</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:41:40.750"
        end="00:41:41.833"><span region="Default">-Thank you, sir.<br/>-Good work.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:41:43.166"
        end="00:41:44.625"><span region="Default">-We're proud of you.<br/>-Thank you, ma'am.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:41:45.416"
        end="00:41:46.708"><span region="Default">-Yes!<br/>-Yes!</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:41:55.541"
        end="00:41:57.125"><span region="Default">-General?<br/>-Yes?</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:41:57.541"
        end="00:42:00.250"><span region="Default">The weapon you mentioned<br/>is now in my hands.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:42:01.666"
        end="00:42:06.666"><span region="Default">How did you retrieve it so quickly<br/>from such a high-security zone?</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:42:06.875"
        end="00:42:10.083"><span region="Default">By killing three hundred of our soldiers.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:42:11.833"
        end="00:42:13.125"><span region="Default">Our soldiers?</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:42:14.125"
        end="00:42:15.208"><span region="Default">And the government?</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:42:15.666"
        end="00:42:18.375"><span region="Default">Leave that aside, sir.<br/>Just tell me where to use it.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:42:19.458"
        end="00:42:23.166"><span region="Default">There's someone else<br/>who can tell you where to use it.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:42:23.250"
        end="00:42:24.916"><span region="Default">-Who?<br/>-Thakur!</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:42:25.000"
        end="00:42:25.916"><span region="Default">Thakur?</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:42:27.625"
        end="00:42:29.000"><span region="Default">-Indian?<br/>-Yeah!</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:42:31.125"
        end="00:42:32.000"><span region="Default">I've said it before.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:42:32.833"
        end="00:42:38.375"><span region="Default">If you want to hurt India,<br/>attack its roots.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:42:39.916"
        end="00:42:41.000"><span region="Default">This Thakur…</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:42:41.833"
        end="00:42:46.208"><span region="Default">can make a man quake behind closed doors</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:42:47.208"
        end="00:42:51.750"><span region="Default">and stir an entire crowd in the open.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:42:52.000"
        end="00:42:54.750"><span region="Default">India's most powerful political leader.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:42:55.000"
        end="00:42:55.916"><span region="Default">Thakur.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:42:56.083"
        end="00:42:57.583"><span region="Default">Ajith Thakur!</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:43:20.458"
        end="00:43:22.041"><span region="Default">TRUTH ALWAYS TRIUMPHS</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:43:31.083"
        end="00:43:32.958"><span region="Default">Sir, Mr. Ajith Thakur has arrived.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:43:34.750"
        end="00:43:35.708"><span region="Default">Please, this way.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:43:35.875"
        end="00:43:37.166"><span region="Default">Greetings.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:43:44.041"
        end="00:43:45.875"><span region="Default">According to intelligence reports,</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:43:45.958"
        end="00:43:50.666"><span region="Default">you had a hand in the Manipur riots.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:43:51.041"
        end="00:43:55.375"><span region="Default">You set a beautiful state on fire.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:43:55.541"
        end="00:43:59.125"><span region="Default">Why trouble the officials?</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:44:00.458"
        end="00:44:02.708"><span region="Default">If you'd asked me,<br/>I would've told you.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:44:03.166"
        end="00:44:04.375"><span region="Default">I planned it.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:44:05.291"
        end="00:44:06.500"><span region="Default">My people carried it out.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:44:07.208"
        end="00:44:08.833"><span region="Default">-The reason?<br/>-Because of you!</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:44:09.583"
        end="00:44:12.500"><span region="Default">-Me?<br/>-The seat you hold now…</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:44:13.958"
        end="00:44:16.916"><span region="Default">That seat once belonged to my father.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:44:20.416"
        end="00:44:22.375"><span region="Default">You hold it now only by circumstance.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:44:23.833"
        end="00:44:24.708"><span region="Default">Doesn't that sting?</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:44:25.875"
        end="00:44:28.958"><span region="Default">The chair I'm meant to occupy…</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:44:30.166"
        end="00:44:33.375"><span region="Default">you're still sitting in it.<br/>Doesn't that hurt?</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:44:34.791"
        end="00:44:37.333"><span region="Default">That's what sparked<br/>the flames over there.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:44:40.875"
        end="00:44:43.416"><span region="Default">I'm placing you under arrest.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:44:45.500"
        end="00:44:46.416"><span region="Default">Mr. PM.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:44:47.458"
        end="00:44:51.791"><span region="Default">For politicians like us,<br/>arrests used to be a real punishment.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:44:52.583"
        end="00:44:53.541"><span region="Default">Now, they're just a trend.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:44:53.875"
        end="00:44:55.541"><span region="Default">I always go by trend.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:44:55.958"
        end="00:44:59.291"><span region="Default">As long as people like me<br/>are in the opposition,</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:45:00.125"
        end="00:45:02.083"><span region="Default">these fires will keep burning.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:45:03.250"
        end="00:45:05.166"><span region="Default">People will keep dying.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:45:06.000"
        end="00:45:09.958"><span region="Default">And I'll keep blaming you for it.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:45:10.750"
        end="00:45:13.666"><span region="Default">They get the flames,<br/>you get the soot.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:45:13.875"
        end="00:45:15.750"><span region="Default">People are watching, Thakur.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:45:17.875"
        end="00:45:18.833"><span region="Default">People?</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:45:20.166"
        end="00:45:23.791"><span region="Default">If someone dies<br/>and you give them 25 lakh rupees,</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:45:23.875"
        end="00:45:25.583"><span region="Default">I'll top that with two crores.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:45:26.291"
        end="00:45:30.166"><span region="Default">If you award two medals,<br/>I'll top that with 12!</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:45:30.916"
        end="00:45:34.291"><span region="Default">Now, tell me,<br/>who will the people follow?</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:45:36.000"
        end="00:45:38.416"><span region="Default">You or me?</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:45:38.875"
        end="00:45:42.458"><span region="Default">Thakur, this seat is full of patience.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:45:42.583"
        end="00:45:44.875"><span region="Default">It thinks before it reacts.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:45:45.041"
        end="00:45:48.458"><span region="Default">The One above has little patience.<br/>Be careful!</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:45:48.541"
        end="00:45:51.416"><span region="Default">Even when you show up,<br/>you can't intimidate me.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:45:51.916"
        end="00:45:54.208"><span region="Default">So how could someone who's not even here?</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:45:55.708"
        end="00:45:56.750"><span region="Default">Goodbye.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:46:00.666"
        end="00:46:01.541"><span region="Default">Make the laddoos quickly.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:46:01.625"
        end="00:46:03.625"><span region="Default">It's your birthday, dear!<br/>When are you coming?</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:46:04.000"
        end="00:46:08.000"><span region="Default">Our project is moving<br/>to the next stage, auntie.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:46:08.500"
        end="00:46:10.541"><span region="Default">I can't make it this time, auntie.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:46:10.708"
        end="00:46:12.250"><span region="Default">-Not possible?<br/>-She really can't come?</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:46:12.500"
        end="00:46:14.291"><span region="Default">If it's impossible,<br/>tell her Dad won't allow it.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:46:14.375"
        end="00:46:16.333"><span region="Default">-Right, right, right!<br/>-He won't allow it.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:46:16.583"
        end="00:46:19.875"><span region="Default">Isn't this the only festival<br/>your dad celebrates since Mom left?</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:46:19.958"
        end="00:46:20.833"><span region="Default">How can you refuse?</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:46:20.916"
        end="00:46:24.208"><span region="Default">Convince Dad I can't make it this once.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:46:24.291"
        end="00:46:26.000"><span region="Default">Please, auntie.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:46:29.208"
        end="00:46:30.083"><span region="Default">Who's on the line?</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:46:30.500"
        end="00:46:32.500"><span region="Default">-It's from home, ma'am.<br/>-What's up?</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:46:32.791"
        end="00:46:36.833"><span region="Default">Because it's my birthday,<br/>they're pressuring me to come home.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:46:38.000"
        end="00:46:40.250"><span region="Default">-You told them you can't?<br/>-Yes, ma'am, I told them I couldn't.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:46:41.625"
        end="00:46:42.500"><span region="Default">Tell them you're coming.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:46:43.916"
        end="00:46:46.125"><span region="Default">Not just you, tell them<br/>your friends are also coming.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:46:46.458"
        end="00:46:47.875"><span region="Default">What about the project, ma'am?</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:46:48.041"
        end="00:46:50.125"><span region="Default">Permission for human trials<br/>is still pending.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:46:50.333"
        end="00:46:51.958"><span region="Default">So, just go and enjoy. Have fun!</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:46:52.333"
        end="00:46:53.250"><span region="Default">Ma'am…</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:46:54.166"
        end="00:46:56.125"><span region="Default">Why don't you come along as well, ma'am!</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:46:58.833"
        end="00:46:59.708"><span region="Default">Is your hometown beautiful?</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:47:06.000"
        end="00:47:07.000"><span region="Default">You need to add more.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:47:07.458"
        end="00:47:10.083"><span region="Default">The more coriander you add,<br/>the tastier the uggani will be.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:47:10.500"
        end="00:47:12.083"><span region="Default">Oh no, that's a lot of spice.<br/>It's too much.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:47:12.166"
        end="00:47:14.958"><span region="Default">Rayalaseema is meant for spicy food, man.<br/>My daughter loves it.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:47:15.541"
        end="00:47:18.000"><span region="Default">-Add a little cashew, man.<br/>-I've already added it, sir.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:47:18.166"
        end="00:47:20.041"><span region="Default">Come on, add some more.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:47:21.000"
        end="00:47:22.250"><span region="Default">She really enjoys it.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:47:22.750"
        end="00:47:25.250"><span region="Default">Ravi, add a little ghee<br/>and taste it once it boils.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:47:25.500"
        end="00:47:28.708"><span region="Default">Sir, you made me finish the whole pot<br/>just by asking me to taste it!</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:47:29.125"
        end="00:47:31.791"><span region="Default">For your skills, you should be<br/>handling guns and hits,</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:47:32.041"
        end="00:47:33.875"><span region="Default">but instead, you're fussing<br/>over salt and pulses.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:47:33.958"
        end="00:47:36.125"><span region="Default">My daughter is coming home after so long.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:47:36.208"
        end="00:47:37.583"><span region="Default">She loves these curries.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:47:37.666"
        end="00:47:39.791"><span region="Default">We know. We're here<br/>to take care of it all.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:47:39.958"
        end="00:47:43.250"><span region="Default">Have we ever interfered in your work?<br/>So why intrude in ours?</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:47:45.458"
        end="00:47:47.416"><span region="Default">Don't argue with him.<br/>You'll be out before lunch.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:47:47.625"
        end="00:47:48.791"><span region="Default">Dad.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:48:01.375"
        end="00:48:02.458"><span region="Default">Dad.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:48:05.375"
        end="00:48:07.375"><span region="Default">Sir, your daughter's calling.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:48:08.041"
        end="00:48:09.291"><span region="Default">Dad!</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:48:12.666"
        end="00:48:15.166"><span region="Default">A sulking lion is a sorry sight!</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:48:15.250"
        end="00:48:16.750"><span region="Default">It's our little one, sir.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:48:17.291"
        end="00:48:19.750"><span region="Default">Ravi uncle, don't shout at Dad.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:48:22.458"
        end="00:48:23.916"><span region="Default">You said you wouldn't come, dear?</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:48:24.500"
        end="00:48:25.833"><span region="Default">I made it, right?</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:48:26.166"
        end="00:48:28.666"><span region="Default">Not just me,<br/>my whole team came.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:48:28.750"
        end="00:48:30.416"><span region="Default">Especially my ma'am!</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:48:30.666"
        end="00:48:31.666"><span region="Default">Really? Is ma'am here?</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:48:33.583"
        end="00:48:35.416"><span region="Default">Hello, Bala.<br/>I'm Archana Goswami.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:48:36.916"
        end="00:48:38.000"><span region="Default">Tough…</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:48:38.500"
        end="00:48:42.583"><span region="Default">After hearing Janani talk about you,<br/>I imagined your range…</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:48:46.041"
        end="00:48:47.666"><span region="Default">Food arrangements are…</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:48:50.000"
        end="00:48:50.958"><span region="Default">mind-blowing!</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:48:52.250"
        end="00:48:53.750"><span region="Default">-Go freshen up.<br/>-Yeah.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:48:53.833"
        end="00:48:55.708"><span region="Default">I'll get the food ready.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:48:55.875"
        end="00:48:56.750"><span region="Default">Alright.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:48:58.708"
        end="00:49:01.583"><span region="Default">Janani, first go and meet your grandma.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:49:05.291"
        end="00:49:07.375"><span region="Default">This breath, this voice, this body,</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:49:08.333"
        end="00:49:10.458"><span region="Default">my aim, my path, and my arrival,</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:49:10.708"
        end="00:49:12.375"><span region="Default">under the control of that divine couple.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:49:13.875"
        end="00:49:17.416"><span region="Default">This birth is dedicated to Lord Shiva,<br/>the next life will be as He commands.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:49:24.041"
        end="00:49:25.333"><span region="Default">Shiva!</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:49:26.416"
        end="00:49:27.375"><span region="Default">Grandma!</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:49:32.208"
        end="00:49:35.875"><span region="Default">Grandma, what is this?<br/>I've seen you since childhood.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:49:36.291"
        end="00:49:40.458"><span region="Default">You never come out, eat properly,<br/>or talk to anyone.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:49:40.625"
        end="00:49:45.416"><span region="Default">Ignoring the people who care<br/>and scolding those who don't is pointless.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:49:46.916"
        end="00:49:49.333"><span region="Default">He kept my child away from me since birth.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:49:50.666"
        end="00:49:52.833"><span region="Default">He kept you away from your mother's love.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:49:53.791"
        end="00:49:55.208"><span region="Default">When his father passed away,</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:49:55.958"
        end="00:49:59.166"><span region="Default">he didn't even let him<br/>perform the last rites.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:49:59.375"
        end="00:50:00.416"><span region="Default">Grandma…</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:50:00.750"
        end="00:50:05.291"><span region="Default">when you're next to them,<br/>and they don't even care,</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:50:05.791"
        end="00:50:08.333"><span region="Default">why ruin your health thinking about it?</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:50:09.666"
        end="00:50:14.375"><span region="Default">After all, they say he took me,<br/>raised me, and saved my life.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:50:14.625"
        end="00:50:17.958"><span region="Default">I don't really remember all that.<br/>Why are you doing this?</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:50:18.041"
        end="00:50:19.666"><span region="Default">At least he showed up for you.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:50:20.708"
        end="00:50:22.375"><span region="Default">For me, it's a mother-child bond.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:50:24.458"
        end="00:50:25.541"><span region="Default">I couldn't break it.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:50:27.291"
        end="00:50:30.458"><span region="Default">That's why I pray to Lord Shiva,</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:50:31.541"
        end="00:50:36.666"><span region="Default">"Will You ever send my child,<br/>or will You take me instead?"</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:50:37.041"
        end="00:50:38.333"><span region="Default">Shiva!</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:50:38.958"
        end="00:50:40.958"><span region="Default">Alright, cool. Where's my gift?</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:50:41.875"
        end="00:50:44.416"><span region="Default">Grandma, it's my birthday.<br/>Where's the gift?</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:50:44.500"
        end="00:50:45.666"><span region="Default">I forgot, dear.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:50:53.083"
        end="00:50:54.375"><span region="Default">Thank you, Grandma.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:50:57.541"
        end="00:50:59.333"><span region="Default">Feels like I'm looking at your mother.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:51:01.291"
        end="00:51:05.125"><span region="Default">Grandma, today you have to eat with me.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:51:05.791"
        end="00:51:08.041"><span region="Default">No, dear. Don't ask me that again.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:51:08.583"
        end="00:51:10.833"><span region="Default">I won't come. You go ahead.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:51:28.250"
        end="00:51:29.250"><span region="Default">Where's he now?</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:51:30.458"
        end="00:51:31.375"><span region="Default">Ravi!</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:51:31.791"
        end="00:51:34.208"><span region="Default">So, is it time for the drinks?</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:51:34.291"
        end="00:51:36.666"><span region="Default">Right, we should get it before dinner.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:51:36.750"
        end="00:51:38.625"><span region="Default">-It's a dry day for you!<br/>-Dry day?!</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:51:38.708"
        end="00:51:42.416"><span region="Default">Yes, sir. As soon as it arrived,<br/>ma'am seized all the booze.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:51:42.541"
        end="00:51:43.416"><span region="Default">Seized?</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:51:43.500"
        end="00:51:46.500"><span region="Default">The lady who came with our daughter<br/>is a senior army officer.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:51:46.625"
        end="00:51:49.250"><span region="Default">She felt it'd be improper<br/>for you to drink in front of her,</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:51:49.500"
        end="00:51:51.625"><span region="Default">-So she said, "Seize the bottles!"<br/>-Oh my!</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:51:52.458"
        end="00:51:54.541"><span region="Default">I need two rounds<br/>or the food won't settle, man.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:51:55.500"
        end="00:51:57.916"><span region="Default">Fine, go get two bottles from town.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:51:58.000"
        end="00:52:02.791"><span region="Default">You shut all the wine shops,<br/>saying it's too late after 8:00 p.m.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:52:02.875"
        end="00:52:04.041"><span region="Default">Looks like you forgot.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:52:26.750"
        end="00:52:27.625"><span region="Default">Cheers!</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:52:33.750"
        end="00:52:35.833"><span region="Default">Hey, Bala! Come have a drink.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:52:36.916"
        end="00:52:39.416"><span region="Default">No, ma'am, my sir doesn't drink.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:52:39.791"
        end="00:52:42.625"><span region="Default">He can't even handle the smell.<br/>Ask anyone.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:52:44.166"
        end="00:52:45.041"><span region="Default">Bala…</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:52:46.375"
        end="00:52:47.958"><span region="Default">this is a really nice drink.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:52:48.958"
        end="00:52:51.166"><span region="Default">One sip, and you'll never forget it.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:52:51.375"
        end="00:52:54.791"><span region="Default">Ma'am, that's wrong.<br/>Our sir is Bala Murali Krishna.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:52:55.000"
        end="00:52:58.208"><span region="Default">He consumes honey but never alcohol.<br/>Ask anyone if you want.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:52:59.958"
        end="00:53:01.208"><span region="Default">People say, "Atithi Devo Bhava."</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:53:01.666"
        end="00:53:02.791"><span region="Default">It means if a guest asks,</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:53:02.875"
        end="00:53:03.916"><span region="Default">-it's God's will.<br/>-Yes, sir.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:53:04.083"
        end="00:53:05.916"><span region="Default">We do it even if we're not used to it.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:53:06.541"
        end="00:53:07.416"><span region="Default">Please pour it.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:53:08.583"
        end="00:53:09.625"><span region="Default">With hot water.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:53:11.541"
        end="00:53:13.333"><span region="Default">Go and bring it.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:53:13.541"
        end="00:53:15.083"><span region="Default">-Young ma'am seized. Big ma'am opened.<br/>-Please come.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:53:15.166"
        end="00:53:16.041"><span region="Default">I'm the scapegoat in the middle.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:53:17.583"
        end="00:53:21.916"><span region="Default">Bala, this is a defense drink.<br/>Have your first peg neat.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:53:23.000"
        end="00:53:26.500"><span region="Default">It's strong, but it tastes great.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:53:28.166"
        end="00:53:30.125"><span region="Default">-To peace in the world!<br/>-And to you.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:53:37.208"
        end="00:53:39.083"><span region="Default">Another one. Come on.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:53:42.625"
        end="00:53:46.208"><span region="Default">I know how parties run on our premises.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:53:47.000"
        end="00:53:52.375"><span region="Default">But the birthday party<br/>you planned for her, a small…</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:53:53.166"
        end="00:53:54.083"><span region="Default">It's going to be great, right?</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:53:55.416"
        end="00:53:58.291"><span region="Default">Trust me, it'll turn out great.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:53:59.000"
        end="00:54:01.958"><span region="Default">Black is your braid<br/>And your headscarf is red</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:54:02.333"
        end="00:54:03.291"><span region="Default">Loudly!</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:54:03.541"
        end="00:54:04.458"><span region="Default">With love!</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:54:04.625"
        end="00:54:06.291"><span region="Default">Dance away!</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:54:06.500"
        end="00:54:09.791"><span region="Default">O queen of beauty<br/>Mind your headscarf</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:54:09.875"
        end="00:54:11.041"><span region="Default">Sing with me!</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:54:11.416"
        end="00:54:14.791"><span region="Default">Black is your braid<br/>And your headscarf is red</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:54:15.583"
        end="00:54:16.833"><span region="Default">Hey, birthday baby!</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:54:17.000"
        end="00:54:18.458"><span region="Default">Come on to the dais.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:54:18.833"
        end="00:54:20.250"><span region="Default">Today is your day.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:54:20.500"
        end="00:54:23.458"><span region="Default">What do you want?<br/>A classy beat or a massy one?</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:54:25.125"
        end="00:54:27.208"><span region="Default">Seems like we've seen it all, ma'am.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:54:27.541"
        end="00:54:30.583"><span region="Default">All we need is the local vibe.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:54:30.750"
        end="00:54:32.791"><span region="Default">When they hear it, it should hit hard.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:54:33.166"
        end="00:54:35.875"><span region="Default">You need some heat!</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:54:37.166"
        end="00:54:40.958"><span region="Default">To set the beat<br/>And move your seat</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:54:41.833"
        end="00:54:43.000"><span region="Default">Come on!</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:54:56.000"
        end="00:54:59.000"><span region="Default">Praise to the supreme being</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:54:59.083"
        end="00:55:02.125"><span region="Default">A ragi bite became a melody<br/>And my heart fell for it</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:55:02.208"
        end="00:55:05.208"><span region="Default">Praise to the supreme being</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:55:05.291"
        end="00:55:08.250"><span region="Default">A ragi bite became a melody<br/>And my heart fell for it</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:55:08.333"
        end="00:55:11.375"><span region="Default">Praise to the supreme being</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:55:11.458"
        end="00:55:14.416"><span region="Default">Look! The rooster turned into<br/>A dancer, what magic!</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:55:14.500"
        end="00:55:17.625"><span region="Default">He's a Nandamuri, and<br/>His beauty is unmatched</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:55:17.708"
        end="00:55:21.916"><span region="Default">He's one in a hundred<br/>His energy is explosive!</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:55:22.291"
        end="00:55:25.041"><span region="Default">His muscles are massive!</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:55:25.125"
        end="00:55:28.375"><span region="Default">This, this is exactly<br/>What we wanted! Let it flow!</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:55:28.458"
        end="00:55:31.541"><span region="Default">His muscles are massive<br/>His muscles are massive</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:55:31.625"
        end="00:55:34.625"><span region="Default">His muscles are massive<br/>He jumps like Devaraya!</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:55:40.875"
        end="00:55:43.916"><span region="Default">The dust flies high<br/>The dust flies high</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:55:44.000"
        end="00:55:46.958"><span region="Default">The dust flies high<br/>His sneeze is that of Krishnaraya!</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:55:47.041"
        end="00:55:50.083"><span region="Default">Praise to the supreme being</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:55:50.166"
        end="00:55:53.166"><span region="Default">A ragi bite became a melody<br/>And my heart fell for it</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:55:53.250"
        end="00:55:56.291"><span region="Default">Praise to the supreme being</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:55:56.375"
        end="00:55:59.208"><span region="Default">Look! The rooster turned into<br/>A dancer, what magic!</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:55:59.291"
        end="00:56:02.041"><span region="Default">There's no one to match<br/>You in style and swag</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:56:02.125"
        end="00:56:05.083"><span region="Default">Your Hindupur steps are swoon worthy</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:56:05.333"
        end="00:56:08.208"><span region="Default">Ananthapur is everywhere around</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:56:08.291"
        end="00:56:11.500"><span region="Default">There's no end to the wonders in<br/>Your celebrations</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:56:25.291"
        end="00:56:31.416"><span region="Default">Mass style excites me<br/>And my rhythm makes everyone dance</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:56:37.625"
        end="00:56:44.000"><span region="Default">I'm fierce, and my swagger<br/>Handles every challenge</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:56:44.333"
        end="00:56:47.416"><span region="Default">His curled mustache is<br/>A sharp sword</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:56:47.500"
        end="00:56:51.791"><span region="Default">His bright attire causes<br/>A spectacle</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:56:52.083"
        end="00:56:54.958"><span region="Default">His muscles are massive!</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:56:55.166"
        end="00:56:58.208"><span region="Default">His muscles are massive<br/>His muscles are massive</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:56:58.291"
        end="00:57:01.375"><span region="Default">His muscles are massive<br/>He jumps like Devaraya!</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:57:07.541"
        end="00:57:10.583"><span region="Default">The dust flies high<br/>The dust flies high</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:57:10.666"
        end="00:57:13.666"><span region="Default">The dust flies high<br/>His sneeze is that of Krishnaraya!</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:57:13.750"
        end="00:57:16.750"><span region="Default">Praise to the supreme being</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:57:16.833"
        end="00:57:19.916"><span region="Default">A ragi bite became a melody<br/>And my heart fell for it</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:57:20.000"
        end="00:57:23.000"><span region="Default">Praise to the supreme being</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:57:23.083"
        end="00:57:26.000"><span region="Default">Look! The rooster turned into<br/>A dancer, what magic!</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:57:26.083"
        end="00:57:28.750"><span region="Default">There's no one to match<br/>You in style and swag</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:57:28.833"
        end="00:57:32.000"><span region="Default">Your Hindupur steps are swoon worthy</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:57:32.083"
        end="00:57:34.916"><span region="Default">Ananthapur is everywhere around</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:57:35.000"
        end="00:57:38.250"><span region="Default">There's no end to the wonders in<br/>Your celebrations</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:57:38.708"
        end="00:57:40.041"><span region="Default">Hey, baby!</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:57:40.250"
        end="00:57:42.125"><span region="Default">-Are you happy?<br/>-Yes, yes!</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:57:42.208"
        end="00:57:45.166"><span region="Default">-Yeah, yeah, yeah, yeah<br/>-Come after me</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:57:45.291"
        end="00:57:48.125"><span region="Default">-Yeah, yeah, yeah, yeah<br/>-Sing after me</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:57:48.375"
        end="00:57:51.125"><span region="Default">Yeah, yeah, yeah, yeah<br/>Victory to Balayya</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:57:51.208"
        end="00:57:54.375"><span region="Default">This is hugely intoxicating, oh boy!</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:57:54.583"
        end="00:57:57.166"><span region="Default">Yeah, yeah, yeah, yeah<br/>Victory to Balayya</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:57:57.666"
        end="00:58:00.583"><span region="Default">Feels like I'm about to take off!</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:58:00.791"
        end="00:58:03.375"><span region="Default">Yeah, yeah, yeah, yeah<br/>Victory to Balayya</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:58:03.458"
        end="00:58:06.791"><span region="Default">This is hugely intoxicating, oh boy!</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:58:15.083"
        end="00:58:16.416"><span region="Default">Thank you so much, Bala.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:58:17.458"
        end="00:58:20.583"><span region="Default">I've seen a whole new world here.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:58:21.833"
        end="00:58:25.750"><span region="Default">My mom passed away when I was a kid.<br/>Dad was an army major.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:58:26.416"
        end="00:58:29.500"><span region="Default">I've been raised around<br/>army life since I was a kid.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:58:30.208"
        end="00:58:33.708"><span region="Default">That's when<br/>I lost my dad in the Kargil war.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:58:35.708"
        end="00:58:40.208"><span region="Default">That's when I realized<br/>what honor in death really means.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:58:41.166"
        end="00:58:44.916"><span region="Default">That inspired me a lot<br/>to join the army.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:58:46.458"
        end="00:58:50.958"><span region="Default">Wherever I go, I love<br/>clicking photos of what I like.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:58:51.666"
        end="00:58:55.125"><span region="Default">But this time, I captured<br/>every moment in my heart.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:58:55.625"
        end="00:58:58.250"><span region="Default">This is your home too.<br/>You're welcome anytime.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:58:58.916"
        end="00:59:03.500"><span region="Default">I'm glad Janani is training<br/>under such a great person.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:59:05.916"
        end="00:59:07.166"><span region="Default">I need to tell you something.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:59:07.666"
        end="00:59:11.625"><span region="Default">Janani is not like everyone else.<br/>She's something special.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:59:12.458"
        end="00:59:15.750"><span region="Default">One day, she will be<br/>a great asset to this country.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:59:15.833"
        end="00:59:17.791"><span region="Default">-Mark my words.<br/>-Thank you very much.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:59:18.708"
        end="00:59:21.208"><span region="Default">I've got to go now.<br/>Where's she?</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:59:22.333"
        end="00:59:26.750"><span region="Default">Grandma, I'm part of the<br/>country's most prestigious project.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:59:27.000"
        end="00:59:32.291"><span region="Default">To finish it well,<br/>I shouldn't carry any stress.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:59:32.375"
        end="00:59:35.958"><span region="Default">-Especially tension about you.<br/>-Nothing will happen to me, dear.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:59:36.250"
        end="00:59:39.791"><span region="Default">How can I not when you're thinking<br/>about the son who never returns?</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:59:40.333"
        end="00:59:43.250"><span region="Default">Who said he won't come, dear?<br/>He'll come.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:59:44.375"
        end="00:59:45.458"><span region="Default">He will surely come.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:59:46.791"
        end="00:59:48.833"><span region="Default">The one who took him will bring him back.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="00:59:59.000"
        end="00:59:59.916"><span region="Default">Thakur…</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:00:00.041"
        end="01:00:02.250"><span region="Default">Hi, Mr. Chang.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:00:02.916"
        end="01:00:07.583"><span region="Default">General, this is my old friend<br/>from India, Mr. Ajith Thakur.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:00:07.916"
        end="01:00:09.791"><span region="Default">He's the most powerful politician.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:00:12.333"
        end="01:00:16.458"><span region="Default">He knows the country's strengths<br/>and weaknesses inside out.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:00:17.791"
        end="01:00:21.333"><span region="Default">Our country has his father's full backing.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:00:23.083"
        end="01:00:26.458"><span region="Default">-Why is he supporting us?<br/>-Mutual benefit!</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:00:28.208"
        end="01:00:30.291"><span region="Default">For you, it's anger over losing your son.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:00:31.958"
        end="01:00:34.541"><span region="Default">For him, it's the desire for position.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:00:35.666"
        end="01:00:38.375"><span region="Default">The weapon's ours,<br/>but he's the one handling it.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:00:38.791"
        end="01:00:41.000"><span region="Default">Are you aware how risky this mission is?</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:00:41.750"
        end="01:00:46.666"><span region="Default">This is a once-in-a-lifetime chance.<br/>What if we miss it?</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:00:48.000"
        end="01:00:49.000"><span region="Default">Don't worry, General!</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:00:49.541"
        end="01:00:52.208"><span region="Default">My country is full of emotional people.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:00:52.625"
        end="01:00:55.666"><span region="Default">When they're happy,<br/>they don't listen to a word.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:00:56.541"
        end="01:00:59.083"><span region="Default">When they're sad,<br/>they'll follow whatever we say.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:00:59.416"
        end="01:01:03.208"><span region="Default">They never bother to check if it's true.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:01:03.458"
        end="01:01:06.250"><span region="Default">Where can I strike<br/>to hurt your nation the most?</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:01:06.416"
        end="01:01:09.125"><span region="Default">A moment like this comes<br/>only once in 140 years.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:01:19.833"
        end="01:01:23.291"><span region="Default">It's a 40-day-long festival<br/>celebrated all over the country.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:01:38.125"
        end="01:01:43.375"><span region="Default">600 million people gather<br/>at one place at the same time…</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:01:43.666"
        end="01:01:46.791"><span region="Default">-Kumbha Mela!<br/>-Maha Kumbha Mela!</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:02:06.083"
        end="01:02:07.583"><span region="Default">The Guru arrives.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:02:08.791"
        end="01:02:09.791"><span region="Default">Bow down and greet them.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:02:09.875"
        end="01:02:11.916"><span region="Default">Salutations to Lord Shiva!</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:03:49.666"
        end="01:03:52.125"><span region="Default">You're so lucky, dear.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:03:52.541"
        end="01:03:55.666"><span region="Default">It took 25 years for me<br/>to visit the Kumbha Mela.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:03:55.875"
        end="01:03:59.250"><span region="Default">But you made it here<br/>at the age of just three.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:03:59.416"
        end="01:04:02.666"><span region="Default">Lord Shiva decides,<br/>and it happens right away.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:04:04.291"
        end="01:04:05.166"><span region="Default">That's it!</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:04:05.250"
        end="01:04:07.166"><span region="Default">Salutations to Lord Shiva!</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:04:09.375"
        end="01:04:11.791"><span region="Default">Shiva…</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:04:15.750"
        end="01:04:19.875"><span region="Default">An invisible war has begun in India.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:04:32.291"
        end="01:04:33.625"><span region="Default">Band Virus!</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:04:34.416"
        end="01:04:39.083"><span region="Default">The virus kicks in within<br/>six hours of entering the body.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:04:39.333"
        end="01:04:43.708"><span region="Default">Six hours from now,<br/>the whole of India will weep!</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:04:47.416"
        end="01:04:49.375"><span region="Default">The holy Ganga bath is done,</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:04:49.458"
        end="01:04:52.541"><span region="Default">got the divine darshan,<br/>now eat this, dear.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:04:53.250"
        end="01:04:54.708"><span region="Default">Very good, dear.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:04:55.333"
        end="01:04:56.791"><span region="Default">Eat the prasadam, dear.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:04:58.125"
        end="01:04:59.583"><span region="Default">Baby! Baby!</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:05:01.000"
        end="01:05:02.583"><span region="Default">Dear! Our baby!</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:05:06.208"
        end="01:05:07.791"><span region="Default">Oh no, why is she bleeding?</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:05:07.875"
        end="01:05:08.791"><span region="Default">Baby!</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:05:09.125"
        end="01:05:11.583"><span region="Default">Oh, no, our baby is bleeding too!</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:05:11.916"
        end="01:05:13.250"><span region="Default">-Baby!<br/>-What's wrong with our baby?</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:05:13.666"
        end="01:05:15.250"><span region="Default">She just collapsed, Dad!</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:05:16.041"
        end="01:05:16.916"><span region="Default">Doctor!</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:05:19.375"
        end="01:05:23.333"><span region="Default">-Doctor, please, check the kid!<br/>-She has fainted. She won't wake up!</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:05:23.416"
        end="01:05:25.083"><span region="Default">-What's wrong with her?<br/>-Are you okay?</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:05:25.166"
        end="01:05:26.208"><span region="Default">Sirisha, what's wrong?</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:05:26.333"
        end="01:05:27.291"><span region="Default">Baby!</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:05:27.791"
        end="01:05:29.125"><span region="Default">-Hey!<br/>-Brother!</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:05:43.458"
        end="01:05:45.500"><span region="Default">Sir, she just fell unconscious!</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:05:46.833"
        end="01:05:48.208"><span region="Default">Move, move, quickly!</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:05:48.750"
        end="01:05:49.625"><span region="Default">Sir…</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:05:49.833"
        end="01:05:51.750"><span region="Default">Yes, Krishnamacharya.<br/>How are you?</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:05:51.833"
        end="01:05:56.166"><span region="Default">Something huge happened here, Chaturvedi!</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:05:56.333"
        end="01:05:58.750"><span region="Default">-What? Where?<br/>-At the Ganga, Chaturvedi.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:05:58.833"
        end="01:06:01.916"><span region="Default">-At the Ganga?<br/>-Please inform the PMO immediately!</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:06:23.875"
        end="01:06:24.750"><span region="Default">What?!</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:06:26.458"
        end="01:06:29.000"><span region="Default">Sir, this looks like a planned biowar.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:06:30.375"
        end="01:06:32.083"><span region="Default">-Are you sure?<br/>-Yes, sir.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:06:32.208"
        end="01:06:35.375"><span region="Default">We're clueless about<br/>its type, nature, and origin.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:06:35.458"
        end="01:06:38.333"><span region="Default">No Indian lab has any record<br/>of this virus.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:06:38.583"
        end="01:06:39.583"><span region="Default">It's being traced, sir.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:06:39.666"
        end="01:06:42.291"><span region="Default">-Who could've done this?<br/>-Our team is working on it, sir.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:06:42.458"
        end="01:06:43.875"><span region="Default">What's the scale of the damage?</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:06:44.083"
        end="01:06:48.250"><span region="Default">The virus spread at the Maha Kumbha Mela,<br/>a nationwide gathering.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:06:48.583"
        end="01:06:53.625"><span region="Default">Our stats show that a few crores<br/>have bathed in the Ganga.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:06:53.875"
        end="01:06:57.541"><span region="Default">Also, 40 countries are<br/>taking part in this event, sir.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:06:57.666"
        end="01:06:59.250"><span region="Default">Seems like big trouble, sir.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:06:59.333"
        end="01:07:01.791"><span region="Default">Move all medical teams<br/>to the affected areas.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:07:01.875"
        end="01:07:04.125"><span region="Default">-Alright, sir.<br/>-Declare it as a medical emergency.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:07:04.458"
        end="01:07:05.333"><span region="Default">Now!</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:07:05.541"
        end="01:07:10.333"><span region="Default">Conquering a forest<br/>isn't only about facing the lion.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:07:10.958"
        end="01:07:15.166"><span region="Default">You also need to bond<br/>with the foxes to win.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:07:16.666"
        end="01:07:18.125"><span region="Default">Watch Thakur now.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:07:27.291"
        end="01:07:29.166"><span region="Default">Please save my brother!</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:07:32.041"
        end="01:07:33.375"><span region="Default">Brother!</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:07:39.083"
        end="01:07:41.291"><span region="Default">Sir, please! These two just fainted.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:07:41.375"
        end="01:07:43.125"><span region="Default">-I don't understand what happened.<br/>-Nothing's going to happen.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:07:43.208"
        end="01:07:44.250"><span region="Default">-Don't worry.<br/>-Sir…</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:07:44.333"
        end="01:07:46.083"><span region="Default">-Sir, please look at our daughter!<br/>-What happened, ma'am?</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:07:46.625"
        end="01:07:49.875"><span region="Default">-Please, sir! Save my daughter!<br/>-Save her, sir, please!</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:07:50.125"
        end="01:07:51.791"><span region="Default">Don't worry, my child. God is with us!</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:07:51.875"
        end="01:07:52.833"><span region="Default">-But…<br/>-Please, don't worry.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:07:52.916"
        end="01:07:54.333"><span region="Default">Everything will be taken care of by God.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:07:54.625"
        end="01:07:56.625"><span region="Default">Sir, the girl is no more.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:08:10.375"
        end="01:08:12.083"><span region="Default">-Sir!<br/>-What's going on?</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:08:12.166"
        end="01:08:13.416"><span region="Default">Sir, what's happening?</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:08:13.500"
        end="01:08:16.541"><span region="Default">You want me to say<br/>that her life was cut short?</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:08:17.208"
        end="01:08:19.166"><span region="Default">Was she taken by the destruction?</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:08:19.625"
        end="01:08:21.250"><span region="Default">Or did she perish while in danger?</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:08:22.416"
        end="01:08:26.333"><span region="Default">That's a lie! People cleanse themselves<br/>in the Ganga. Yet she lost her life.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:08:28.083"
        end="01:08:30.750"><span region="Default">Makes me wonder, does God even exist?</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:08:33.708"
        end="01:08:37.000"><span region="Default">I put my faith in God all this while,<br/>was it nothing but a lie?</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:08:42.333"
        end="01:08:43.291"><span region="Default">He said it.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:08:43.625"
        end="01:08:45.291"><span region="Default">God's got an eye on everyone,</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:08:45.791"
        end="01:08:48.041"><span region="Default">the helpless and the devoted.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:08:48.208"
        end="01:08:50.291"><span region="Default">He's all around, always watching over us.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:08:50.375"
        end="01:08:52.708"><span region="Default">That's exactly what God said!</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:08:53.250"
        end="01:08:54.291"><span region="Default">Where is He?</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:08:55.041"
        end="01:08:58.958"><span region="Default">Where's the one who poured His poison<br/>into the Ganga? Where is He?</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:09:02.125"
        end="01:09:04.583"><span region="Default">They came to worship and ended up<br/>at the cremation grounds.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:09:04.791"
        end="01:09:05.708"><span region="Default">Where is He?</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:09:09.083"
        end="01:09:13.291"><span region="Default">His "sacred water" carried<br/>death to every village. Where is He?</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:09:13.625"
        end="01:09:15.791"><span region="Default">So much has occurred,<br/>yet He has not arrived!</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:09:16.875"
        end="01:09:18.416"><span region="Default">Does God exist?</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:09:19.375"
        end="01:09:20.875"><span region="Default">Does God exist or not?</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:09:20.958"
        end="01:09:22.791"><span region="Default">-No!<br/>-Say it out loud.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:09:22.916"
        end="01:09:26.541"><span region="Default">No! No! No!</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:09:26.625"
        end="01:09:28.291"><span region="Default">No!</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:09:28.375"
        end="01:09:29.875"><span region="Default">No!</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:09:35.625"
        end="01:09:39.583"><span region="Default">If he's not there for us in hard times,</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:09:39.833"
        end="01:09:41.541"><span region="Default">what's the point of having temples<br/>and their towering structures?</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:09:41.875"
        end="01:09:43.666"><span region="Default">Why are festivals and celebrations held?</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:09:43.750"
        end="01:09:46.791"><span region="Default">Do we really need blessed food<br/>and all this propaganda?</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:09:47.125"
        end="01:09:50.250"><span region="Default">-No. We don't.<br/>-My dear!</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:09:54.166"
        end="01:09:55.041"><span region="Default">Hey!</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:09:55.416"
        end="01:09:56.750"><span region="Default">Stop with that!</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:09:57.166"
        end="01:09:58.750"><span region="Default">Didn't you hear our leader said<br/>that God doesn't exist?</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:10:00.458"
        end="01:10:03.791"><span region="Default">Until now, I believed God existed.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:10:04.250"
        end="01:10:06.000"><span region="Default">I believed in Him more than you all did.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:10:10.375"
        end="01:10:13.541"><span region="Default">I am telling you now.<br/>God does not exist.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:10:14.125"
        end="01:10:15.500"><span region="Default">God doesn't exist!</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:10:16.166"
        end="01:10:19.416"><span region="Default">The God who turned us into orphans,</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:10:20.000"
        end="01:10:23.333"><span region="Default">we must also turn Him into an orphan.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:10:24.958"
        end="01:10:29.875"><span region="Default">The relationship between us<br/>and God is now severed.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:10:29.958"
        end="01:10:32.666"><span region="Default">No!</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:10:32.750"
        end="01:10:36.791"><span region="Default">Hey! These fools don't know<br/>when to wipe tears</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:10:37.041"
        end="01:10:38.583"><span region="Default">and when to play dirty politics…</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:10:38.750"
        end="01:10:40.958"><span region="Default">-in this country's politics.<br/>-Yes, sir.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:10:41.250"
        end="01:10:44.958"><span region="Default">Sir, like his father, even the dead<br/>aren't spared from politics.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:10:45.666"
        end="01:10:47.250"><span region="Default">But the sad part is…</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:10:47.500"
        end="01:10:50.166"><span region="Default">people are putting their<br/>faith in criminals of this kind.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:10:51.958"
        end="01:10:53.375"><span region="Default">Sir, I don't understand,</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:10:53.583"
        end="01:10:56.791"><span region="Default">Anytime we messed up,<br/>he'd show us, sir.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:10:57.083"
        end="01:10:58.833"><span region="Default">Now, he's talking about God instead.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:11:00.291"
        end="01:11:01.833"><span region="Default">If these people lose faith in God…</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:11:02.541"
        end="01:11:05.125"><span region="Default">Just one wrong word,<br/>and the country could crumble, sir.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:11:08.541"
        end="01:11:10.708"><span region="Default">If that happens, people<br/>will abandon righteousness.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:11:10.833"
        end="01:11:12.250"><span region="Default">The country will lose control.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:11:12.541"
        end="01:11:15.750"><span region="Default">We won't be able to stop<br/>the chaos then, sir.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:11:15.916"
        end="01:11:17.875"><span region="Default">-The country will be in chaos.<br/>-No!</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:11:18.250"
        end="01:11:19.625"><span region="Default">That must not happen, Rao ji.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:11:20.250"
        end="01:11:22.791"><span region="Default">He's filling people with fear.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:11:23.416"
        end="01:11:25.750"><span region="Default">In that place, we must lift their courage.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:11:26.500"
        end="01:11:29.125"><span region="Default">If we want people to hear<br/>what we have to say,</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:11:29.375"
        end="01:11:31.541"><span region="Default">it is necessary that these<br/>deaths should be stopped.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:11:31.666"
        end="01:11:35.083"><span region="Default">The only way to stop it<br/>is by immediate vaccination, sir.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:11:35.333"
        end="01:11:38.125"><span region="Default">How is that possible on such short notice?</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:11:38.250"
        end="01:11:41.833"><span region="Default">It's possible, sir.<br/>According to WHO guidelines,</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:11:42.000"
        end="01:11:44.916"><span region="Default">we've sent the virus samples<br/>to labs across the country.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:11:45.291"
        end="01:11:47.375"><span region="Default">Round the clock,<br/>they're working on this, sir.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:11:47.916"
        end="01:11:50.958"><span region="Default">Create a hotline between the team and me.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:11:51.166"
        end="01:11:55.166"><span region="Default">-If needed, tell them to call me directly.<br/>-Yes, sir.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:11:55.333"
        end="01:11:56.583"><span region="Default">-Goodbye.<br/>-Thank you, sir.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:11:58.750"
        end="01:12:00.750"><span region="Default">World's most deadliest virus.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:12:01.125"
        end="01:12:02.916"><span region="Default">It's playing with our people's lives.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:12:03.333"
        end="01:12:07.708"><span region="Default">If we're delayed by hours,<br/>people's lives will be at stake.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:12:08.041"
        end="01:12:11.291"><span region="Default">People will start<br/>losing faith in our country.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:12:11.625"
        end="01:12:15.208"><span region="Default">That should not happen.<br/>Our country is waiting for our answer.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:12:15.375"
        end="01:12:19.291"><span region="Default">Forget about time, forget about family,<br/>forget about everything.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:12:19.708"
        end="01:12:21.166"><span region="Default">Let's do this fight!</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:12:21.458"
        end="01:12:23.666"><span region="Default">Until this bloody devil dies.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:12:23.750"
        end="01:12:24.625"><span region="Default">-Yes, ma'am.<br/>-Got it?</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:12:24.708"
        end="01:12:26.333"><span region="Default">-Yes!<br/>-Yes, that's the spirit.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:12:26.625"
        end="01:12:27.833"><span region="Default">Listen!</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:12:28.291"
        end="01:12:31.458"><span region="Default">We're prepping defenses<br/>using the Bio Shield Code procedure.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:12:31.541"
        end="01:12:33.833"><span region="Default">-With that, we can intercept the virus.<br/>-Ma'am…</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:12:34.291"
        end="01:12:36.000"><span region="Default">we're stuck on the human trials.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:12:36.583"
        end="01:12:39.500"><span region="Default">Yes, ma'am, without human trials,<br/>we cannot move forward.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:12:47.041"
        end="01:12:47.958"><span region="Default">Then try it on me.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:12:50.416"
        end="01:12:52.375"><span region="Default">-What?!<br/>-Then try it on me!</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:12:52.916"
        end="01:12:55.000"><span region="Default">Ma'am, this isn't a vaccine.<br/>It's the virus.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:12:55.291"
        end="01:12:59.208"><span region="Default">The enemy can strike in any form,<br/>we must be ready to fight as soldiers.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:12:59.666"
        end="01:13:01.250"><span region="Default">So, let's do this!</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:13:01.625"
        end="01:13:02.500"><span region="Default">Right?</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:13:03.916"
        end="01:13:04.791"><span region="Default">Come on, do it.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:13:09.250"
        end="01:13:10.958"><span region="Default">-You do it.<br/>-No, ma'am.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:13:17.583"
        end="01:13:20.333"><span region="Default">-Janani, you lead the trial.<br/>-Yes, ma'am.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:13:23.458"
        end="01:13:24.750"><span region="Default">Bio Shield vaccine.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:13:28.083"
        end="01:13:30.083"><span region="Default">Let her breathe.<br/>Please get back.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:13:36.041"
        end="01:13:36.916"><span region="Default">Don't worry.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:13:51.791"
        end="01:13:54.500"><span region="Default">People are dying! Why focus on<br/>temples and worship now?</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:13:54.708"
        end="01:13:56.291"><span region="Default">Leave! Come on!</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:13:56.875"
        end="01:13:57.833"><span region="Default">Oh, Lord!</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:13:58.500"
        end="01:14:02.000"><span region="Default">The protective Ganga has become<br/>a venomous threat.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:14:02.166"
        end="01:14:03.708"><span region="Default">They are blaming You for that sin!</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:14:03.833"
        end="01:14:06.000"><span region="Default">Even the victims are<br/>starting to believe this.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:14:06.250"
        end="01:14:08.375"><span region="Default">How will You stop this disaster?</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:14:09.541"
        end="01:14:12.500"><span region="Default">Lord, they say You don't exist.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:14:12.583"
        end="01:14:14.541"><span region="Default">Prove Yourself.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:14:14.625"
        end="01:14:17.083"><span region="Default">I'll only worship You then.<br/>Until then…</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:14:20.125"
        end="01:14:21.166"><span region="Default">-What do you expect me to do, ma'am?<br/>-We are doing what we can.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:14:21.250"
        end="01:14:22.208"><span region="Default">-We don't know what's happening either!<br/>-We don't know what's happening!</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:14:22.291"
        end="01:14:23.708"><span region="Default">Can't you see how many<br/>people are in there?</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:14:23.791"
        end="01:14:25.375"><span region="Default">We have no idea what to do, sir!</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:15:12.125"
        end="01:15:14.416"><span region="Default">-Sir, we did it!<br/>-Yes!</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:16:07.875"
        end="01:16:09.083"><span region="Default">We made it, sir!</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:16:09.333"
        end="01:16:11.916"><span region="Default">-Yes!<br/>-Yes!</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:16:12.000"
        end="01:16:14.000"><span region="Default">-Yes!<br/>-Yes!</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:16:17.208"
        end="01:16:18.333"><span region="Default">We did it, ma'am.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:16:20.125"
        end="01:16:21.750"><span region="Default">-We need to do something right away--<br/>-Sir!</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:16:22.375"
        end="01:16:23.875"><span region="Default">That bloody virus is dead, sir.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:16:24.083"
        end="01:16:25.333"><span region="Default">Our DRDO found the vaccine.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:16:25.458"
        end="01:16:27.541"><span region="Default">-And it's 100 percent working, sir!<br/>-Good.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:16:28.041"
        end="01:16:32.125"><span region="Default">What's our best option<br/>for mass production?</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:16:32.458"
        end="01:16:35.750"><span region="Default">-Ladakh military lab, sir.<br/>-Send the team and lift them immediately.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:16:35.833"
        end="01:16:36.708"><span region="Default">-Yes, sir!<br/>-Yes, sir.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:16:36.791"
        end="01:16:38.500"><span region="Default">-All checkpoints, alert.<br/>-Yes, sir.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:16:38.791"
        end="01:16:40.833"><span region="Default">-We are starting from the location.<br/>-Okay, sir.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:16:41.083"
        end="01:16:43.333"><span region="Default">-The subject starts in five minutes.<br/>-Done, sir.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:16:49.500"
        end="01:16:51.916"><span region="Default">Guys, the antidote is ready!</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:17:29.375"
        end="01:17:30.791"><span region="Default">Move!</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:17:52.791"
        end="01:17:53.791"><span region="Default">Janani, go!</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:17:53.875"
        end="01:17:55.708"><span region="Default">Get out of this place! Fast!</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:17:57.458"
        end="01:17:58.416"><span region="Default">Darn it!</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:18:20.541"
        end="01:18:22.583"><span region="Default">Move!<br/>Move!</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:18:27.083"
        end="01:18:28.750"><span region="Default">Go! Go home.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:18:28.833"
        end="01:18:30.416"><span region="Default">-Janani, go!<br/>-No.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:18:31.250"
        end="01:18:35.500"><span region="Default">This isn't just a vaccine.<br/>This is the life of our country.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:18:36.375"
        end="01:18:39.666"><span region="Default">Our lives are nothing<br/>compared to its value.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:18:40.208"
        end="01:18:43.083"><span region="Default">You're the one who must protect this.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:18:44.208"
        end="01:18:48.416"><span region="Default">Your bag holds all the details<br/>about where to go and how to get there.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:18:48.833"
        end="01:18:50.375"><span region="Default">-Move, move!<br/>-I'll be safe.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:18:50.458"
        end="01:18:51.416"><span region="Default">Go! Go!</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:19:10.041"
        end="01:19:13.000"><span region="Default">I won't spare her or the vaccine.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:20:46.750"
        end="01:20:49.416"><span region="Default">Brother, we got the antidote.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:20:56.333"
        end="01:20:57.250"><span region="Default">Hey!</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:20:59.000"
        end="01:21:01.500"><span region="Default">-Let it go. Leave it.<br/>-No!</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:21:02.375"
        end="01:21:03.291"><span region="Default">Please!</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:21:04.500"
        end="01:21:05.541"><span region="Default">-Hey!<br/>-No!</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:21:29.875"
        end="01:21:34.500"><span region="Default">Shambho…</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:21:34.583"
        end="01:21:39.500"><span region="Default">This is my promise!</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:21:39.583"
        end="01:21:41.333"><span region="Default">Shambho…</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:21:41.416"
        end="01:21:47.250"><span region="Default">Be it hardship, tears…</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:21:50.000"
        end="01:21:54.208"><span region="Default">I'll stand before you in a moment.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:21:59.041"
        end="01:22:04.041"><span region="Default">This is my promise!</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:22:15.291"
        end="01:22:16.416"><span region="Default">Shiva! Shiva! Shiva!</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:23:06.000"
        end="01:23:07.000"><span region="Default">Baba!</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:23:09.916"
        end="01:23:11.041"><span region="Default">Guys! Kill him!</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:23:13.375"
        end="01:23:14.333"><span region="Default">Shiva! Shiva! Shiva!</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:25:10.458"
        end="01:25:11.916"><span region="Default">You wished for the well-being<br/>of the world.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:25:12.833"
        end="01:25:15.208"><span region="Default">Now, your well-being is<br/>taken care of by Lord Shiva.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:25:16.375"
        end="01:25:19.791"><span region="Default">It's an order.<br/>My Lord's order.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:25:21.916"
        end="01:25:23.250"><span region="Default">May you live long.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:25:28.500"
        end="01:25:34.375"><span region="Default">Destroy all human and spectral evil eyes!</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:25:41.625"
        end="01:25:44.708"><span region="Default">Go, dear! Take that lifeline.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:25:48.708"
        end="01:25:53.291"><span region="Default">Shambho…</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:26:28.750"
        end="01:26:29.666"><span region="Default">Who the hell is this guy?</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:26:30.333"
        end="01:26:31.416"><span region="Default">He governs all the seven lower realms,</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:26:31.500"
        end="01:26:34.833"><span region="Default">namely Atala, Vitala, Sutala, Talatala,<br/>Rasatala, Mahatala, and Patala.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:26:35.750"
        end="01:26:37.333"><span region="Default">The guardian of all the<br/>seven celestial realms,</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:26:37.416"
        end="01:26:39.000"><span region="Default">namely Bhuloka, Bhuvarloka, Suvarloka,</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:26:39.083"
        end="01:26:40.666"><span region="Default">Maharloka, Janoloka,<br/>Tapoloka, and Satyaloka.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:26:40.833"
        end="01:26:41.916"><span region="Default">He's the Lord of the past,<br/>the present, and the future.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:26:42.041"
        end="01:26:43.250"><span region="Default">He's the three-eyed one.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:26:43.541"
        end="01:26:47.083"><span region="Default">The wielder of the trident.<br/>None other than our Lord Shiva!</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:26:47.666"
        end="01:26:48.833"><span region="Default">Hara!</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:27:13.541"
        end="01:27:14.458"><span region="Default">Hey!</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:27:24.083"
        end="01:27:26.875"><span region="Default">Without my Shiva's permission, even Yama,<br/>the God of Death, wouldn't dare look up.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:27:26.958"
        end="01:27:27.958"><span region="Default">How dare you!</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:27:28.041"
        end="01:27:29.791"><span region="Default">How dare you take the lives<br/>of innocent people?</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:27:29.875"
        end="01:27:30.750"><span region="Default">Hey!</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:27:35.708"
        end="01:27:38.000"><span region="Default">If fierce demons like you<br/>descend upon this place,</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:27:38.208"
        end="01:27:40.958"><span region="Default">this land will not allow it to happen<br/>without resistance.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:27:41.250"
        end="01:27:43.958"><span region="Default">It belongs to God!<br/>The Supreme Lord!</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:27:44.416"
        end="01:27:45.875"><span region="Default">If you dare touch it in defiance,</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:27:46.333"
        end="01:27:47.666"><span region="Default">what will happen is the Tandavam,</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:27:48.125"
        end="01:27:51.750"><span region="Default">the Rudra Tandavam, the highest<br/>Cosmic Rudra Tandavam!</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:28:12.916"
        end="01:28:15.208"><span region="Default">The Vow of Truth.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:28:15.458"
        end="01:28:17.916"><span region="Default">The Eternal Radiance.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:28:18.166"
        end="01:28:20.541"><span region="Default">The Fundamental Doctrine.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:28:20.666"
        end="01:28:23.208"><span region="Default">The Embodiment of all the Mantras.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:28:23.541"
        end="01:28:25.041"><span region="Default">Shivam!</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:28:27.708"
        end="01:28:28.750"><span region="Default">OM</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:29:24.291"
        end="01:29:27.750"><span region="Default">His Supreme dance</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:29:28.416"
        end="01:29:31.791"><span region="Default">His Infinite dance</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:29:32.458"
        end="01:29:38.208"><span region="Default">This is His glorious arrival</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:29:39.333"
        end="01:29:42.791"><span region="Default">He's the originator of the cosmos</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:29:43.583"
        end="01:29:47.041"><span region="Default">He's the fierce incarnation</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:29:47.583"
        end="01:29:53.000"><span region="Default">He's the cosmic<br/>Brilliance of the universe</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:29:53.666"
        end="01:29:56.750"><span region="Default">His essence is the sacred ash</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:29:57.458"
        end="01:30:02.666"><span region="Default">He is magnificence personified</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:30:42.958"
        end="01:30:44.250"><span region="Default">Inside our own territory…</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:30:44.583"
        end="01:30:49.125"><span region="Default">an attack on our high-security lab?</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:30:49.750"
        end="01:30:51.083"><span region="Default">How did that even happen?</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:30:54.708"
        end="01:30:58.375"><span region="Default">How did someone find out that</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:30:58.666"
        end="01:31:02.291"><span region="Default">the solution to our country's<br/>problem was there?</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:31:07.333"
        end="01:31:08.208"><span region="Default">Sir!</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:31:08.708"
        end="01:31:13.166"><span region="Default">We can't find<br/>any security cameras or hard disks.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:31:13.541"
        end="01:31:17.791"><span region="Default">Sir, there's no one left alive<br/>to tell us what happened here.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:31:17.958"
        end="01:31:19.458"><span region="Default">They've been killed brutally, sir.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:31:25.208"
        end="01:31:27.041"><span region="Default">Our last hope is gone.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:31:27.958"
        end="01:31:32.208"><span region="Default">How do we save the country<br/>from this virus now?</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:31:43.541"
        end="01:31:44.958"><span region="Default">Brother-in-law, Mom is not waking up!</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:31:47.041"
        end="01:31:47.916"><span region="Default">Mom!</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:31:58.500"
        end="01:31:59.375"><span region="Default">Mom!</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:32:00.166"
        end="01:32:01.041"><span region="Default">Mom!</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:32:06.166"
        end="01:32:07.291"><span region="Default">What happened, Mom?</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:32:21.416"
        end="01:32:23.625"><span region="Default">I accept defeat, son.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:32:26.416"
        end="01:32:28.416"><span region="Default">I'm tired of begging…</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:32:28.833"
        end="01:32:35.166"><span region="Default">an unseen God to bring back my child.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:32:35.833"
        end="01:32:38.250"><span region="Default">Even when my son stood before me,</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:32:38.750"
        end="01:32:43.000"><span region="Default">I never heard him call me "Mom."<br/>That's my defeat.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:32:46.416"
        end="01:32:48.708"><span region="Default">But when I die,</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:32:49.291"
        end="01:32:51.458"><span region="Default">my body will return to Earth</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:32:51.666"
        end="01:32:53.916"><span region="Default">only if he performs<br/>my last rites and lights my pyre.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:33:02.041"
        end="01:33:06.375"><span region="Default">I won't find my eternal peace until then.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:33:09.083"
        end="01:33:10.083"><span region="Default">As you say, Mom.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:33:11.916"
        end="01:33:13.916"><span region="Default">Stay right here with me, son.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:33:43.041"
        end="01:33:44.666"><span region="Default">-Hello?<br/>-What happened?</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:33:44.916"
        end="01:33:47.416"><span region="Default">Our guys destroyed the lab…</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:33:48.041"
        end="01:33:50.041"><span region="Default">after eliminating everyone<br/>who made the antidote.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:33:50.125"
        end="01:33:51.041"><span region="Default">Good.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:33:51.125"
        end="01:33:54.166"><span region="Default">However, a scientist<br/>has escaped with the vaccine.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:33:54.250"
        end="01:33:56.375"><span region="Default">-What?!<br/>-But don't worry.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:33:57.125"
        end="01:33:58.750"><span region="Default">My people chased and caught her.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:33:58.958"
        end="01:34:03.041"><span region="Default">Immediately destroy<br/>the vaccine and the scientist!</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:34:03.250"
        end="01:34:04.291"><span region="Default">I am heading there.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:34:20.916"
        end="01:34:21.916"><span region="Default">Hello?</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:34:22.000"
        end="01:34:22.875"><span region="Default">Thakur!</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:34:33.250"
        end="01:34:34.833"><span region="Default">-Ajay…<br/>-Sir!</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:34:37.458"
        end="01:34:38.333"><span region="Default">Ajay!</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:34:38.708"
        end="01:34:39.625"><span region="Default">Hello, Thakur.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:34:40.875"
        end="01:34:42.125"><span region="Default">I just made it there.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:34:44.291"
        end="01:34:46.666"><span region="Default">All of our people have been killed…</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:34:48.375"
        end="01:34:49.833"><span region="Default">including my brother.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:34:49.958"
        end="01:34:51.083"><span region="Default">What about the vaccine?</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:34:51.916"
        end="01:34:52.791"><span region="Default">I don't know.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:34:54.000"
        end="01:34:56.708"><span region="Default">That scientist is also missing.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:34:57.041"
        end="01:35:02.208"><span region="Default">After waiting for so many years,<br/>we've finally taken control of India.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:35:03.166"
        end="01:35:04.500"><span region="Default">Will you let that go?</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:35:06.041"
        end="01:35:09.958"><span region="Default">Stop it from reaching across India!<br/>You have 48 hours.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:36:11.708"
        end="01:36:13.708"><span region="Default">Hey, check if it's him!</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:36:32.916"
        end="01:36:36.083"><span region="Default">Did you light your father's funeral pyre?</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:36:37.416"
        end="01:36:40.708"><span region="Default">Did you light your father's funeral pyre?</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:36:42.375"
        end="01:36:45.375"><span region="Default">Do you at least know<br/>who killed your father?</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:36:45.541"
        end="01:36:46.416"><span region="Default">No.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:36:47.083"
        end="01:36:51.291"><span region="Default">Do you know who killed<br/>your brother and your men?</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:36:51.458"
        end="01:36:52.375"><span region="Default">I don't.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:36:53.500"
        end="01:36:56.750"><span region="Default">-Do you know who I am?<br/>-I don't know.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:36:56.833"
        end="01:37:01.083"><span region="Default">Do you know of the past<br/>that your father and I share?</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:37:03.208"
        end="01:37:04.208"><span region="Default">Listen!</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:37:22.250"
        end="01:37:23.333"><span region="Default">Why did you stop here?</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:37:23.416"
        end="01:37:27.791"><span region="Default">This whole forest lies under the watch<br/>of Tantric master Netra's mystical power.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:37:28.333"
        end="01:37:29.958"><span region="Default">We must walk from here.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:37:30.458"
        end="01:37:32.916"><span region="Default">No matter what happens,<br/>don't look around, sir.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:37:33.166"
        end="01:37:34.750"><span region="Default">The ghosts will tear you apart.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:37:35.333"
        end="01:37:36.625"><span region="Default">Be careful!</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:37:37.041"
        end="01:37:38.041"><span region="Default">Let's go, sir.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:37:47.583"
        end="01:37:50.125"><span region="Default">No, sir! Don't look!</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:37:51.375"
        end="01:37:54.208"><span region="Default">No! Don't look, sir!<br/>Listen to me, sir!</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:37:54.791"
        end="01:37:57.083"><span region="Default">-Don't look, sir!<br/>-Karala…</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:38:04.041"
        end="01:38:05.291"><span region="Default">Who are you all?</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:38:05.958"
        end="01:38:07.166"><span region="Default">What are you doing here?</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:38:07.416"
        end="01:38:09.583"><span region="Default">I'm this country's ruling party MP.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:38:10.291"
        end="01:38:13.500"><span region="Default">There's an obstacle to my goal.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:38:14.750"
        end="01:38:20.041"><span region="Default">I learned that only the great<br/>Tantric Netra can solve this problem.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:38:20.250"
        end="01:38:22.625"><span region="Default">You should've told us<br/>before you came, sir.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:38:22.708"
        end="01:38:27.208"><span region="Default">Given my political standing,<br/>I cannot come here publicly.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:38:30.416"
        end="01:38:31.416"><span region="Default">Please…</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:38:32.583"
        end="01:38:34.625"><span region="Default">arrange for me to meet Netra.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:38:35.208"
        end="01:38:39.208"><span region="Default">Vishachi is currently awakening<br/>a dark force.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:38:40.250"
        end="01:38:42.750"><span region="Default">I will arrange a meeting after that.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:38:50.708"
        end="01:38:51.916"><span region="Default">Lifeless!</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:38:55.125"
        end="01:38:58.291"><span region="Default">The relative you're fighting with<br/>can't speak or walk anymore.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:38:59.000"
        end="01:39:01.166"><span region="Default">He's as good as dead.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:39:04.833"
        end="01:39:06.750"><span region="Default">He won't trouble you anymore, sir.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:39:08.041"
        end="01:39:10.166"><span region="Default">Go without looking back.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:39:23.291"
        end="01:39:25.333"><span region="Default">Vishachi, he is…</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:39:27.541"
        end="01:39:30.291"><span region="Default">You hope to rule the country.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:39:33.125"
        end="01:39:35.458"><span region="Default">You've encountered an obstacle,<br/>haven't you, Thakur?</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:39:38.875"
        end="01:39:40.166"><span region="Default">As you know, Netra,</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:39:40.791"
        end="01:39:44.125"><span region="Default">I've dreamed of ruling<br/>this country for thirty years.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:39:44.708"
        end="01:39:48.125"><span region="Default">For that, I crushed every obstacle<br/>that came in my way</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:39:48.416"
        end="01:39:50.708"><span region="Default">and severed every head that opposed me.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:39:51.166"
        end="01:39:54.458"><span region="Default">After all these years, I finally have<br/>the opportunity to rule the country.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:39:54.625"
        end="01:39:58.208"><span region="Default">There's only one obstacle.<br/>Adithya Ram Bhagath!</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:40:12.500"
        end="01:40:16.708"><span region="Default">We are devotees of Hanuman</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:40:16.791"
        end="01:40:20.916"><span region="Default">We consider climbing mountains<br/>To be child's play</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:40:25.375"
        end="01:40:27.791"><span region="Default">He has the people's support.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:40:27.958"
        end="01:40:30.375"><span region="Default">And also Lord Shiva's backing.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:40:34.250"
        end="01:40:37.083"><span region="Default">To defeat a man as righteous as him…</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:40:38.000"
        end="01:40:41.333"><span region="Default">and to steal his luck<br/>and transfer it to you,</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:40:42.458"
        end="01:40:47.666"><span region="Default">we must awaken terrifying,<br/>god-defying evil powers.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:40:48.833"
        end="01:40:53.583"><span region="Default">If they wake up,<br/>they will demand sacrifice.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:40:53.833"
        end="01:40:57.833"><span region="Default">All I care about now<br/>is my victory and his death!</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:40:58.958"
        end="01:41:01.666"><span region="Default">I will do anything for that, Netra.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:41:03.250"
        end="01:41:06.708"><span region="Default">Then, we must perform a sacrifice<br/>of eight young Brahmins.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:41:08.500"
        end="01:41:12.041"><span region="Default">Bring me ashta vatus who breathe<br/>the Vedas with every breath,</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:41:12.125"
        end="01:41:13.125"><span region="Default">walk the path of dharma,</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:41:13.208"
        end="01:41:16.708"><span region="Default">hold Shiva as their ultimate refuge,<br/>and chant the Rudram every day.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:41:17.833"
        end="01:41:22.333"><span region="Default">I mean, bring eight young Brahmin boys.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:41:24.125"
        end="01:41:26.166"><span region="Default">The moment their heads are severed,</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:41:27.375"
        end="01:41:31.125"><span region="Default">the eight evil spirits will awaken<br/>and come under my control.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:41:31.958"
        end="01:41:36.166"><span region="Default">Your enemy will die<br/>if we complete this ritual.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:41:36.250"
        end="01:41:39.791"><span region="Default">From here on out, under my aegis,</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:41:40.125"
        end="01:41:41.875"><span region="Default">the power is yours…</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:41:42.375"
        end="01:41:45.875"><span region="Default">and the control… is mine.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:41:47.500"
        end="01:41:50.541"><span region="Default">Prepare for the ritual, Prachanda!</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:42:31.291"
        end="01:42:32.208"><span region="Default">Mom!</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:42:33.583"
        end="01:42:34.875"><span region="Default">Mom!</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:42:35.875"
        end="01:42:37.083"><span region="Default">Please spare our kids!</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:42:37.166"
        end="01:42:40.208"><span region="Default">Every chant awakens one evil spirit.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:42:41.583"
        end="01:42:45.583"><span region="Default">By the eighth chant, eight throats<br/>must be cut and their blood spilt.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:42:49.083"
        end="01:42:52.250"><span region="Default">Their heads must fall<br/>into this sacrificial pit!</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:43:48.583"
        end="01:43:49.458"><span region="Default">Jata!</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:43:58.458"
        end="01:43:59.458"><span region="Default">Netra!</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:44:08.333"
        end="01:44:09.416"><span region="Default">You are making a mistake!</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:44:10.166"
        end="01:44:16.000"><span region="Default">Our gurus knew those evil creatures<br/>might corrupt people like us.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:44:16.500"
        end="01:44:20.416"><span region="Default">They imprisoned those terrifying<br/>forces using Pashana Bandhanam.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:44:21.458"
        end="01:44:24.458"><span region="Default">You shouldn't try to awaken them.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:44:24.541"
        end="01:44:25.666"><span region="Default">That's wrong!</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:44:26.708"
        end="01:44:29.458"><span region="Default">You are sacrificing innocent lives.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:44:29.541"
        end="01:44:31.291"><span region="Default">That is a bigger mistake.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:44:35.666"
        end="01:44:36.958"><span region="Default">Prachanda…</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:44:39.208"
        end="01:44:40.125"><span region="Default">Netra!</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:44:47.291"
        end="01:44:48.916"><span region="Default">How dare you oppose our Vishachi?</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:44:49.625"
        end="01:44:51.708"><span region="Default">Hey! I will kill you!</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:44:56.250"
        end="01:44:58.416"><span region="Default">I invoke the lineage of dark forces!</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:45:05.041"
        end="01:45:06.541"><span region="Default">Shiva! Shambho!</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:45:56.958"
        end="01:45:58.625"><span region="Default">Shiva! Shambho!</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:48:01.416"
        end="01:48:02.458"><span region="Default">Hara!</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:49:27.208"
        end="01:49:29.500"><span region="Default">Shiva! Shambho!</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:49:29.583"
        end="01:49:32.375"><span region="Default">If you awaken the evil spirits,<br/>the Lord of Spirits will retaliate!</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:49:36.750"
        end="01:49:40.125"><span region="Default">Lord Shiva will appear<br/>if you provoke those spirits!</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:49:51.166"
        end="01:49:54.750"><span region="Default">If armies of dark forces gather,<br/>Shiva's army will surge forward.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:49:54.833"
        end="01:49:55.708"><span region="Default">Hey!</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:50:03.208"
        end="01:50:06.625"><span region="Default">The code of the dark forces<br/>is to kill ten people to save one.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:50:07.166"
        end="01:50:11.375"><span region="Default">The code of Shiva<br/>is to risk one life to save ten!</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:50:11.750"
        end="01:50:13.708"><span region="Default">That is the dharma that Shiva taught us.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:50:14.875"
        end="01:50:16.291"><span region="Default">Anyone who obstructs it,</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:50:16.750"
        end="01:50:19.791"><span region="Default">be it ghosts, evil spirits,<br/>or even people like you,</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:50:20.208"
        end="01:50:23.208"><span region="Default">we will pursue and strike you down!</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:50:23.666"
        end="01:50:25.083"><span region="Default">We will keep severing your evil heads!</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:50:25.666"
        end="01:50:26.666"><span region="Default">Your time is up!</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:50:33.875"
        end="01:50:36.250"><span region="Default">Hey! You destroyed my destiny.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:50:36.333"
        end="01:50:37.375"><span region="Default">Hey!</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:50:38.750"
        end="01:50:40.916"><span region="Default">Based on your past karma,<br/>the dharma you follow,</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:50:41.250"
        end="01:50:43.625"><span region="Default">the merits you've earned<br/>and the sins you carry,</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:50:43.916"
        end="01:50:47.708"><span region="Default">the Supreme Lord inscribes<br/>your rank and status upon your brow.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:50:48.166"
        end="01:50:50.208"><span region="Default">You tried to erase that with blood…</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:50:51.875"
        end="01:50:53.416"><span region="Default">and change it with dark magic!</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:50:54.500"
        end="01:50:57.583"><span region="Default">You tried to sacrifice innocent,<br/>Rudram-chanting children!</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:50:58.166"
        end="01:51:00.583"><span region="Default">How dare you disturb my God's order!</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:51:16.333"
        end="01:51:19.041"><span region="Default">That's how he killed your father<br/>right in front of my eyes!</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:51:20.833"
        end="01:51:24.000"><span region="Default">He thought I was dead and left me.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:51:24.791"
        end="01:51:30.166"><span region="Default">Today, I wield immense power<br/>with terrifying demons under my control!</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:51:33.875"
        end="01:51:35.375"><span region="Default">Come.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:51:36.250"
        end="01:51:39.541"><span region="Default">I will show you the death<br/>of your father's killer!</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:52:09.666"
        end="01:52:11.458"><span region="Default">What's been weighing on your mind?</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:52:11.583"
        end="01:52:14.708"><span region="Default">You always worship and praise God, right?</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:52:15.166"
        end="01:52:18.708"><span region="Default">Where is your God<br/>while so many are losing their lives?</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:52:18.833"
        end="01:52:21.291"><span region="Default">The whole universe<br/>vibrates with Shiva's essence.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:52:21.916"
        end="01:52:23.666"><span region="Default">He is everything. He is in everything.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:52:24.083"
        end="01:52:24.958"><span region="Default">Is he?</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:52:25.333"
        end="01:52:28.041"><span region="Default">Then is he the cause of all these deaths?</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:52:28.333"
        end="01:52:29.750"><span region="Default">God's not behind this.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:52:30.541"
        end="01:52:32.041"><span region="Default">It's a fool who lost his mind!</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:52:32.208"
        end="01:52:34.041"><span region="Default">So why is your God not here to save them?</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:52:34.166"
        end="01:52:35.166"><span region="Default">He sent you!</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:52:35.708"
        end="01:52:38.166"><span region="Default">He gave you the power<br/>to protect their lives, didn't he?</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:52:38.541"
        end="01:52:42.166"><span region="Default">So our discovery was nothing?<br/>It's all your God's doing?</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:52:42.375"
        end="01:52:44.583"><span region="Default">Shiva is the power,<br/>and we are His instruments.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:52:45.291"
        end="01:52:48.833"><span region="Default">That's why he sent you to discover,<br/>and me to protect.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:52:52.000"
        end="01:52:55.958"><span region="Default">Then the one who separated Grandma<br/>from you… is Lord Shiva, right?</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:53:13.083"
        end="01:53:15.458"><span region="Default">He separated a mother from her son…</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:53:16.166"
        end="01:53:20.208"><span region="Default">Your Lord Shiva left her<br/>in lifelong misery!</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:53:20.333"
        end="01:53:21.791"><span region="Default">Human birth depends on karma.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:53:23.000"
        end="01:53:25.875"><span region="Default">Life, the fetus in the womb,<br/>and the bond at birth,</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:53:26.166"
        end="01:53:27.458"><span region="Default">are all Lord Shiva's will.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:53:29.458"
        end="01:53:32.333"><span region="Default">Who is born to whom,<br/>who grows in whose care,</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:53:32.583"
        end="01:53:36.583"><span region="Default">their purpose and destiny<br/>are all decided by Lord Shiva.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:53:49.500"
        end="01:53:51.916"><span region="Default">Your daughter<br/>is in a critical condition, sir.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:53:53.875"
        end="01:53:56.750"><span region="Default">-Doctor, what do you mean by critical?<br/>-I have nothing to say, ma'am.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:53:56.875"
        end="01:53:58.125"><span region="Default">We can't do anything<br/>until the vaccine arrives.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:53:58.208"
        end="01:53:59.791"><span region="Default">Vaccine? When will it arrive?</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:54:09.041"
        end="01:54:13.916"><span region="Default">You said my daughter was born<br/>with a firm belief in Shiva, right, Dad?</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:54:14.166"
        end="01:54:16.541"><span region="Default">Is Shiva taking her away?</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:54:18.125"
        end="01:54:21.166"><span region="Default">No, dear. No! This is…</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:54:21.958"
        end="01:54:24.333"><span region="Default">Don't think of it as a divine punishment.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:54:25.041"
        end="01:54:28.500"><span region="Default">Let's consider it a test from God.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:54:29.416"
        end="01:54:34.083"><span region="Default">It's time to rely on God more than ever.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:54:35.083"
        end="01:54:37.500"><span region="Default">Do you still believe in God, Dad?</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:54:38.666"
        end="01:54:39.583"><span region="Default">Yes, dear.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:54:40.625"
        end="01:54:45.458"><span region="Default">I've witnessed how Shiva comes,<br/>and what follows in his wake.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:54:46.125"
        end="01:54:47.666"><span region="Default">Stay strong, dear.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:54:48.083"
        end="01:54:50.750"><span region="Default">Not for you, me, or anyone else…</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:54:51.208"
        end="01:54:54.083"><span region="Default">He will come to protect<br/>the world he watches over!</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:54:54.375"
        end="01:54:59.416"><span region="Default">Those who made many suffer<br/>to erase his existence…</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:55:00.541"
        end="01:55:01.958"><span region="Default">he will come to punish them!</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:55:02.250"
        end="01:55:04.166"><span region="Default">Lord Shiva wouldn't spare them, dear.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:55:04.583"
        end="01:55:07.166"><span region="Default">He'll come. He'll definitely come.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:55:08.041"
        end="01:55:09.375"><span region="Default">Believe me, dear.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:55:40.666"
        end="01:55:43.791"><span region="Default">The reliever of untimely suffering,<br/>for the peace of all beings…</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:55:43.916"
        end="01:55:46.000"><span region="Default">Salutations to the Lord of the Wind.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:55:52.666"
        end="01:55:55.666"><span region="Default">The timeless flow through all ages,<br/>and the divine purity of the Ganga…</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:55:55.750"
        end="01:55:58.250"><span region="Default">Salutations to the Lord of Water.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:56:02.916"
        end="01:56:05.875"><span region="Default">The radiant one with eyes of light,<br/>and the eternal flame itself…</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:56:05.958"
        end="01:56:08.333"><span region="Default">Salutations to the Lord of Fire.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:56:10.875"
        end="01:56:14.291"><span region="Default">The one clothed in holy ash<br/>and symbol of eternal truth…</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:56:14.375"
        end="01:56:16.750"><span region="Default">Salutations to the Lord of Ashes.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:56:30.375"
        end="01:56:32.333"><span region="Default">Hey, ascetic! What are you doing there?</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:56:33.000"
        end="01:56:34.833"><span region="Default">There is no God there. Leave.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:56:36.291"
        end="01:56:37.208"><span region="Default">Why did you take down the fence?</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:56:46.708"
        end="01:56:49.166"><span region="Default">Why are you people so angry with God?</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:56:49.375"
        end="01:56:50.583"><span region="Default">Why shouldn't we be?</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:56:50.750"
        end="01:56:53.166"><span region="Default">We believed a dip<br/>in the Ganges would get us salvation.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:56:53.250"
        end="01:56:55.208"><span region="Default">Your Lord put our lives at risk.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:56:55.833"
        end="01:56:58.250"><span region="Default">What does God gain by hurting you?</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:56:58.625"
        end="01:57:01.750"><span region="Default">Does the Lord need a virus to kill you?</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:57:02.041"
        end="01:57:04.791"><span region="Default">Does he really need to drag you<br/>all the way to the Kumbha Mela?</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:57:05.875"
        end="01:57:07.666"><span region="Default">Couldn't he strike<br/>your house with thunder,</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:57:08.000"
        end="01:57:10.666"><span region="Default">or flood it with the ocean<br/>with just a snap?</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:57:10.791"
        end="01:57:14.250"><span region="Default">You defend Him, but if He exists,<br/>shouldn't He save lives? Where is He?</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:57:18.708"
        end="01:57:19.916"><span region="Default">Imagine you have a friend.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:57:20.708"
        end="01:57:22.833"><span region="Default">He called you, but you didn't answer.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:57:23.500"
        end="01:57:27.083"><span region="Default">From his perspective, are you<br/>just unavailable, or already dead?</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:57:27.208"
        end="01:57:29.125"><span region="Default">What do you mean?<br/>I'm only unavailable.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:57:29.250"
        end="01:57:32.708"><span region="Default">Now tell me, if you can't see God,<br/>does that mean he doesn't exist?</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:57:34.791"
        end="01:57:35.833"><span region="Default">Who knows?</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:57:36.416"
        end="01:57:39.583"><span region="Default">Maybe God is already among you,<br/>here to solve your problems.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:57:39.875"
        end="01:57:40.875"><span region="Default">Do you know?</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:57:49.333"
        end="01:57:55.083"><span region="Default">We believed in him and traveled<br/>hundreds of miles to queue up in temples.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:57:55.375"
        end="01:57:58.208"><span region="Default">Our legs ached, but our problems stayed.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:57:58.416"
        end="01:58:01.958"><span region="Default">Imagine a beloved relative visits you.<br/>What would you do?</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:58:02.291"
        end="01:58:05.875"><span region="Default">What else? Even if it's hard,<br/>we'd host them for a few days,</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:58:05.958"
        end="01:58:07.750"><span region="Default">treat them well, and send them off.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:58:07.875"
        end="01:58:09.208"><span region="Default">God is the same!</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:58:10.000"
        end="01:58:12.458"><span region="Default">He made you stay<br/>in his presence for hours,</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:58:12.750"
        end="01:58:16.541"><span region="Default">not to trouble you,<br/>but because he loves you.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:58:18.458"
        end="01:58:20.291"><span region="Default">Don't think of your troubles<br/>as punishment.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:58:20.875"
        end="01:58:22.708"><span region="Default">See it as God's discipline.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:58:23.458"
        end="01:58:24.666"><span region="Default">You'll go far in life.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:58:24.791"
        end="01:58:26.958"><span region="Default">Enough with the stories!<br/>If God exists, ask Him to come.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:58:27.041"
        end="01:58:28.500"><span region="Default">-We'll see!<br/>-Should He come?</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:58:29.333"
        end="01:58:31.791"><span region="Default">Which of his principles have you upheld,<br/>that he should come to you?</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:58:32.375"
        end="01:58:37.291"><span region="Default">For generations, the Sanatana Dharma<br/>has stood behind you and guided you.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:58:37.458"
        end="01:58:39.916"><span region="Default">You're ruining it through your actions.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:58:40.666"
        end="01:58:41.958"><span region="Default">Should He come for that?</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:58:43.625"
        end="01:58:47.875"><span region="Default">These days, money matters more.<br/>We go where the money is.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:58:48.166"
        end="01:58:51.375"><span region="Default">We won't survive<br/>if we still follow the dharma!</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:58:51.458"
        end="01:58:53.708"><span region="Default">No one falls sick from a mother's milk,</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:58:54.250"
        end="01:58:56.875"><span region="Default">and no one stays healthy<br/>drinking the artificial kind.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:58:57.416"
        end="01:58:58.291"><span region="Default">That's why they say,</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:58:58.541"
        end="01:59:00.291"><span region="Default">"It is preferable to die<br/>in the discharge of one's duty</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:59:00.375"
        end="01:59:02.041"><span region="Default">than to follow the path of another,<br/>which is fraught with danger."</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:59:02.375"
        end="01:59:04.708"><span region="Default">Had you followed<br/>your own dharma properly,</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:59:05.000"
        end="01:59:07.875"><span region="Default">no one else's would be ruling over you!</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:59:09.791"
        end="01:59:10.708"><span region="Default">Yes!</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:59:10.791"
        end="01:59:14.833"><span region="Default">Be it Lord Rama's tale in the Ramayana<br/>or Lord Krishna's in the Bhagavata,</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:59:15.083"
        end="01:59:17.333"><span region="Default">if one truly studies them,<br/>what moral cannot be found?</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:59:17.625"
        end="01:59:19.583"><span region="Default">What question remains unanswered?</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:59:19.708"
        end="01:59:21.791"><span region="Default">Why blame God<br/>when you haven't followed His path?</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:59:23.708"
        end="01:59:27.000"><span region="Default">You'll find religions<br/>in the rest of the world.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:59:27.625"
        end="01:59:30.416"><span region="Default">But in this land, you'll find dharma.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:59:30.583"
        end="01:59:32.500"><span region="Default">Sanatana Hindu Dharma!</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:59:40.250"
        end="01:59:42.333"><span region="Default">You may find the end of the sky,</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:59:42.833"
        end="01:59:46.208"><span region="Default">but you'll never find<br/>the limits of our Sanatana Dharma!</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:59:46.625"
        end="01:59:50.750"><span region="Default">If you follow this dharma, you can<br/>teach a lesson to anyone, anywhere.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:59:54.041"
        end="01:59:55.875"><span region="Default">What is Sanatana Dharma, lord?</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:59:55.958"
        end="01:59:58.958"><span region="Default">It's about how to live with nature,<br/>align with the universe,</span></p>
      <p
        begin="01:59:59.291"
        end="02:00:01.750"><span region="Default">and how to lead life<br/>as a supreme intelligent being.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="02:00:02.125"
        end="02:00:04.833"><span region="Default">That way of life is Sanatana Dharma.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="02:00:06.416"
        end="02:00:08.166"><span region="Default">But what are you doing?</span></p>
      <p
        begin="02:00:08.333"
        end="02:00:11.958"><span region="Default">Who occupied the rivers<br/>and turned God's rain into floods?</span></p>
      <p
        begin="02:00:12.333"
        end="02:00:14.250"><span region="Default">It's you and your selfishness!</span></p>
      <p
        begin="02:00:16.041"
        end="02:00:19.666"><span region="Default">Who polluted everything with waste?</span></p>
      <p
        begin="02:00:19.875"
        end="02:00:21.875"><span region="Default">It's you and your selfishness!</span></p>
      <p
        begin="02:00:23.875"
        end="02:00:25.875"><span region="Default">Who polluted the food we eat,<br/>the air we breathe,</span></p>
      <p
        begin="02:00:26.166"
        end="02:00:28.083"><span region="Default">the water we drink, and even the soil,</span></p>
      <p
        begin="02:00:28.458"
        end="02:00:30.583"><span region="Default">and cut life expectancy<br/>from 100 years to 50?</span></p>
      <p
        begin="02:00:30.750"
        end="02:00:32.583"><span region="Default">It's you and your selfishness!</span></p>
      <p
        begin="02:00:34.375"
        end="02:00:37.125"><span region="Default">Besides, are you feeding your parents,<br/>at the very least?</span></p>
      <p
        begin="02:00:37.541"
        end="02:00:39.041"><span region="Default">No! You send them to old age homes.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="02:00:39.416"
        end="02:00:41.291"><span region="Default">Do you respect your teachers?</span></p>
      <p
        begin="02:00:41.625"
        end="02:00:43.125"><span region="Default">No! You turn your face away.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="02:00:43.416"
        end="02:00:45.083"><span region="Default">You feel ashamed<br/>of talking to elders,</span></p>
      <p
        begin="02:00:45.166"
        end="02:00:49.791"><span region="Default">bowing to God, going to the temple,<br/>wearing bindi, having prasadam…</span></p>
      <p
        begin="02:00:50.041"
        end="02:00:51.750"><span region="Default">You feel ashamed of everything!</span></p>
      <p
        begin="02:00:52.083"
        end="02:00:54.208"><span region="Default">That's why they are turning<br/>prasadam into poison</span></p>
      <p
        begin="02:00:54.500"
        end="02:00:56.916"><span region="Default">and using temples for political games.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="02:00:57.416"
        end="02:01:00.583"><span region="Default">You turn the savior God<br/>into a source of income!</span></p>
      <p
        begin="02:01:00.666"
        end="02:01:02.958"><span region="Default">Why should God appear<br/>for people like you?</span></p>
      <p
        begin="02:01:03.291"
        end="02:01:05.375"><span region="Default">Does he have to show up with a signboard?</span></p>
      <p
        begin="02:01:07.291"
        end="02:01:08.916"><span region="Default">Only two truths exist in this universe.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="02:01:09.750"
        end="02:01:13.708"><span region="Default">One is the God who protects you,<br/>and the other is the dharma you follow.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="02:01:14.250"
        end="02:01:15.916"><span region="Default">Sanatana Hindu Dharma.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="02:01:21.541"
        end="02:01:24.666"><span region="Default">When the deadly poison shook the world,</span></p>
      <p
        begin="02:01:24.750"
        end="02:01:27.416"><span region="Default">my Lord Shiva cupped it in a conch<br/>and held it in his throat!</span></p>
      <p
        begin="02:01:27.833"
        end="02:01:30.416"><span region="Default">Is this newly born virus<br/>a big deal to him?</span></p>
      <p
        begin="02:01:30.750"
        end="02:01:34.250"><span region="Default">We will see its end!<br/>And the end of its creator!</span></p>
      <p
        begin="02:01:34.958"
        end="02:01:37.791"><span region="Default">Where evil rises, God stands against it.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="02:01:38.375"
        end="02:01:39.791"><span region="Default">Be brave!</span></p>
      <p
        begin="02:01:56.791"
        end="02:01:57.666"><span region="Default">Ma'am!</span></p>
      <p
        begin="02:01:59.375"
        end="02:02:00.250"><span region="Default">Sir!</span></p>
      <p
        begin="02:02:04.333"
        end="02:02:07.041"><span region="Default">Janani is alive, sir.<br/>The vaccine is with her.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="02:02:08.750"
        end="02:02:10.125"><span region="Default">We've traced her location, sir.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="02:02:10.458"
        end="02:02:13.166"><span region="Default">-Send the rescue team immediately.<br/>-Yes, sir.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="02:02:13.250"
        end="02:02:14.125"><span region="Default">-Okay, sir.<br/>-Yeah.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="02:02:48.750"
        end="02:02:52.250"><span region="Default">Shiva! Shiva! Shiva! Shambho!</span></p>
      <p
        begin="02:02:58.250"
        end="02:03:00.500"><span region="Default">Hail Lord Mahadev!</span></p>
      <p
        begin="02:03:02.166"
        end="02:03:04.750"><span region="Default">The God of Gods, Mahadev!</span></p>
      <p
        begin="02:03:29.375"
        end="02:03:32.666"><span region="Default">I've found you<br/>after all these years, Akhanda!</span></p>
      <p
        begin="02:03:34.083"
        end="02:03:36.791"><span region="Default">I stitched my cut tongue,</span></p>
      <p
        begin="02:03:38.625"
        end="02:03:41.958"><span region="Default">set my broken bones,</span></p>
      <p
        begin="02:03:43.583"
        end="02:03:46.583"><span region="Default">fixed my popped eye,</span></p>
      <p
        begin="02:03:48.125"
        end="02:03:50.000"><span region="Default">healed my burnt skin,</span></p>
      <p
        begin="02:03:50.083"
        end="02:03:53.000"><span region="Default">and returned just to kill you!</span></p>
      <p
        begin="02:03:53.125"
        end="02:03:55.291"><span region="Default">Salutations to Lord Shiva!</span></p>
      <p
        begin="02:03:58.041"
        end="02:04:00.791"><span region="Default">Here, two things decide who lives or dies.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="02:04:01.458"
        end="02:04:04.541"><span region="Default">One is time, and the other<br/>is the trident in my hand!</span></p>
      <p
        begin="02:04:07.541"
        end="02:04:12.500"><span region="Default">Today, my body is home<br/>to the power of eight demons!</span></p>
      <p
        begin="02:04:13.291"
        end="02:04:17.500"><span region="Default">It's an armor<br/>that even your Rudra can't pierce!</span></p>
      <p
        begin="02:04:20.250"
        end="02:04:21.166"><span region="Default">Shiva…</span></p>
      <p
        begin="02:04:22.708"
        end="02:04:25.000"><span region="Default">This fool is challenging the Brahmastra!</span></p>
      <p
        begin="02:04:26.000"
        end="02:04:28.875"><span region="Default">Should I spare him, or spar with him?</span></p>
      <p
        begin="02:04:29.000"
        end="02:04:30.666"><span region="Default">Come…</span></p>
      <p
        begin="02:04:30.750"
        end="02:04:34.208"><span region="Default">Even though you denied my essence,<br/>you remembered me every day.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="02:04:34.916"
        end="02:04:36.833"><span region="Default">That's why, though<br/>you grew up among demons,</span></p>
      <p
        begin="02:04:37.875"
        end="02:04:40.291"><span region="Default">I'll kill you here,<br/>in the presence of Lord Shiva!</span></p>
      <p
        begin="02:04:45.875"
        end="02:04:49.250"><span region="Default">Shiva! Shiva! Shiva! Shambho!</span></p>
      <p
        begin="02:07:13.333"
        end="02:07:14.916"><span region="Default">Son of Kesari, destroyer of demons,</span></p>
      <p
        begin="02:07:15.000"
        end="02:07:16.708"><span region="Default">born of Rudra's fire,<br/>shining with divine strength,</span></p>
      <p
        begin="02:07:16.791"
        end="02:07:18.500"><span region="Default">wielder of mace, Hanuman…</span></p>
      <p
        begin="02:07:19.750"
        end="02:07:21.333"><span region="Default">I bow down!</span></p>
      <p
        begin="02:08:46.750"
        end="02:08:50.041"><span region="Default">I bow to the Lord</span></p>
      <p
        begin="02:08:50.416"
        end="02:08:52.875"><span region="Default">The incarnation of Rudra</span></p>
      <p
        begin="02:08:56.125"
        end="02:08:57.041"><span region="Default">Uncle!</span></p>
      <p
        begin="02:09:42.583"
        end="02:09:44.333"><span region="Default">May you experience<br/>the consequences of sin!</span></p>
      <p
        begin="02:09:58.666"
        end="02:09:59.541"><span region="Default">Baba…</span></p>
      <p
        begin="02:10:00.833"
        end="02:10:02.416"><span region="Default">Grandma's dead.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="02:10:39.958"
        end="02:10:41.916"><span region="Default">You just found out your mother's dead.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="02:10:42.583"
        end="02:10:45.375"><span region="Default">Does it not affect you at all?</span></p>
      <p
        begin="02:10:48.083"
        end="02:10:50.708"><span region="Default">You were all she thought about every day.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="02:10:51.000"
        end="02:10:53.583"><span region="Default">She waited each day,<br/>hoping you'd come.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="02:10:53.791"
        end="02:10:55.833"><span region="Default">She hoped every day to see you, Baba.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="02:10:58.375"
        end="02:11:02.333"><span region="Default">She died before her last wish came true.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="02:11:04.875"
        end="02:11:07.166"><span region="Default">If only you'd visited her once…</span></p>
      <p
        begin="02:11:07.291"
        end="02:11:09.416"><span region="Default">she might've lived a little longer.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="02:11:11.541"
        end="02:11:13.625"><span region="Default">Maybe you don't feel that way,</span></p>
      <p
        begin="02:11:13.875"
        end="02:11:16.375"><span region="Default">but as a mother,<br/>wouldn't she have formed an attachment?</span></p>
      <p
        begin="02:11:19.000"
        end="02:11:22.750"><span region="Default">Even if you want to see her now,<br/>you can't.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="02:11:23.791"
        end="02:11:25.583"><span region="Default">Her final wish couldn't be fulfilled.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="02:11:27.416"
        end="02:11:29.500"><span region="Default">Even when people are dying,<br/>your Lord is nowhere to be seen!</span></p>
      <p
        begin="02:11:30.000"
        end="02:11:32.250"><span region="Default">Your mother is dead,<br/>and you show no emotion.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="02:11:32.916"
        end="02:11:34.833"><span region="Default">Why are you silent, Baba?</span></p>
      <p
        begin="02:11:35.333"
        end="02:11:38.041"><span region="Default">Are you and your God heartless?</span></p>
      <p
        begin="02:12:28.250"
        end="02:12:29.125"><span region="Default">Son!</span></p>
      <p
        begin="02:12:33.166"
        end="02:12:35.750"><span region="Default">-What's wrong, son?<br/>-If I light her pyre,</span></p>
      <p
        begin="02:12:36.791"
        end="02:12:40.625"><span region="Default">her body will turn to ashes,<br/>but her soul won't find peace.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="02:12:42.125"
        end="02:12:46.250"><span region="Default">Her last wish…<br/>was that Akhanda perform her final rites.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="02:12:47.416"
        end="02:12:49.166"><span region="Default">There's nothing wrong with that, son.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="02:12:50.000"
        end="02:12:54.000"><span region="Default">But they live in a world<br/>hidden away from the rest of us.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="02:12:54.500"
        end="02:12:57.541"><span region="Default">Do you think he can come<br/>and perform her rites?</span></p>
      <p
        begin="02:12:57.750"
        end="02:12:59.958"><span region="Default">Sir, he's right.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="02:13:00.208"
        end="02:13:03.333"><span region="Default">The auspicious time's running out.<br/>Is he even aware of the situation?</span></p>
      <p
        begin="02:13:03.958"
        end="02:13:06.416"><span region="Default">Aren't you her son, too?<br/>Please perform the last rites.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="02:14:01.041"
        end="02:14:04.666"><span region="Default">The life-giving Shankara<br/>Plays His cosmic game</span></p>
      <p
        begin="02:14:04.916"
        end="02:14:08.708"><span region="Default">The karma we spin<br/>The debts we carry</span></p>
      <p
        begin="02:14:08.791"
        end="02:14:11.375"><span region="Default">He sets them aflame</span></p>
      <p
        begin="02:14:11.500"
        end="02:14:15.375"><span region="Default">The sacred bond of mother and child<br/>So strong, so dear</span></p>
      <p
        begin="02:14:15.458"
        end="02:14:21.625"><span region="Default">Is broken at last<br/>In the quiet glow of her funeral pyre</span></p>
      <p
        begin="02:14:22.500"
        end="02:14:27.666"><span region="Default">She bore with hope for joy</span></p>
      <p
        begin="02:14:27.750"
        end="02:14:32.291"><span region="Default">You're finally here<br/>To fulfill her wish</span></p>
      <p
        begin="02:14:33.041"
        end="02:14:38.208"><span region="Default">Her whole life she waited<br/>Yearning for You</span></p>
      <p
        begin="02:14:38.291"
        end="02:14:42.458"><span region="Default">To rise beyond this world<br/>And walk heaven's mile</span></p>
      <p
        begin="02:14:43.083"
        end="02:14:48.041"><span region="Default">When life's bundle unravels<br/>Only ashes remain</span></p>
      <p
        begin="02:14:48.125"
        end="02:14:51.041"><span region="Default">As her body burns upon the pyre</span></p>
      <p
        begin="02:14:51.125"
        end="02:14:53.541"><span region="Default">Her memories ascend to You</span></p>
      <p
        begin="02:14:53.666"
        end="02:14:58.375"><span region="Default">Shiva! Shiva! Shiva!<br/>Shiva! Shiva! Shiva! Come!</span></p>
      <p
        begin="02:14:58.958"
        end="02:15:04.000"><span region="Default">Hara! Hara! Hara! Hara!<br/>Hara! Hara! Come!</span></p>
      <p
        begin="02:15:04.083"
        end="02:15:09.041"><span region="Default">Shiva! Shiva! Shiva!<br/>Shiva! Shiva! Shiva! Come!</span></p>
      <p
        begin="02:15:09.458"
        end="02:15:14.666"><span region="Default">Hara! Hara! Hara! Hara!<br/>Hara! Hara! Come!</span></p>
      <p
        begin="02:15:16.000"
        end="02:15:17.250"><span region="Default">Lord Shiva!</span></p>
      <p
        begin="02:15:46.125"
        end="02:15:49.375"><span region="Default">Are you here<br/>as this poor woman's son…</span></p>
      <p
        begin="02:15:50.166"
        end="02:15:54.583"><span region="Default">to perform the rites<br/>and grant her final wish?</span></p>
      <p
        begin="02:16:00.083"
        end="02:16:03.833"><span region="Default">Your son's out there<br/>risking his life for me.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="02:16:04.750"
        end="02:16:09.791"><span region="Default">Shouldn't I return that grace?</span></p>
      <p
        begin="02:16:12.583"
        end="02:16:16.958"><span region="Default">You've cursed me all your life…<br/>for taking your child away.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="02:16:17.583"
        end="02:16:19.000"><span region="Default">You've questioned me a lot.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="02:16:19.791"
        end="02:16:21.916"><span region="Default">Who should answer you, Mother?</span></p>
      <p
        begin="02:16:23.041"
        end="02:16:24.000"><span region="Default">I should, right?</span></p>
      <p
        begin="02:16:26.333"
        end="02:16:28.250"><span region="Default">You're the sacred mother,</span></p>
      <p
        begin="02:16:28.583"
        end="02:16:30.958"><span region="Default">who carried my voice, virtue,<br/>body, and thoughts</span></p>
      <p
        begin="02:16:32.166"
        end="02:16:33.333"><span region="Default">for nine months.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="02:16:34.083"
        end="02:16:37.958"><span region="Default">Who must make your one wish come true?</span></p>
      <p
        begin="02:16:39.125"
        end="02:16:40.208"><span region="Default">I should. Right?</span></p>
      <p
        begin="02:16:42.041"
        end="02:16:47.166"><span region="Default">If I, who has seen many hardships<br/>and never wavered</span></p>
      <p
        begin="02:16:48.375"
        end="02:16:50.750"><span region="Default">felt moved enough<br/>to come down to perform these rites,</span></p>
      <p
        begin="02:16:51.708"
        end="02:16:55.000"><span region="Default">it's because… of my devotee.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="02:16:57.125"
        end="02:16:59.083"><span region="Default">For the lives of his countrymen,</span></p>
      <p
        begin="02:16:59.958"
        end="02:17:01.375"><span region="Default">for the sake of upholding righteousness</span></p>
      <p
        begin="02:17:01.958"
        end="02:17:04.791"><span region="Default">and to defend the honor of God,</span></p>
      <p
        begin="02:17:05.333"
        end="02:17:07.958"><span region="Default">he's waging war, risking his life.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="02:17:08.375"
        end="02:17:12.916"><span region="Default">Am I not obligated<br/>to such a great devotee of mine?</span></p>
      <p
        begin="02:17:13.875"
        end="02:17:14.791"><span region="Default">That's why,</span></p>
      <p
        begin="02:17:15.458"
        end="02:17:17.083"><span region="Default">I've stepped forward myself.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="02:17:19.875"
        end="02:17:24.083"><span region="Default">I came as your son<br/>to perform your last rites.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="02:17:24.958"
        end="02:17:28.208"><span region="Default">Mother, I came praying<br/>to fill your heart with light.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="02:17:28.791"
        end="02:17:29.750"><span region="Default">But…</span></p>
      <p
        begin="02:17:30.333"
        end="02:17:33.125"><span region="Default">I couldn't fool a mother.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="02:17:34.666"
        end="02:17:36.083"><span region="Default">Does this helpless woman…</span></p>
      <p
        begin="02:17:36.416"
        end="02:17:38.291"><span region="Default">deserve such fortune?</span></p>
      <p
        begin="02:17:38.500"
        end="02:17:40.583"><span region="Default">Even God has to come down</span></p>
      <p
        begin="02:17:41.000"
        end="02:17:43.250"><span region="Default">for the sake of a selfless mother.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="02:17:46.208"
        end="02:17:50.875"><span region="Default">Even a leaf or a drop of water<br/>can move Lord Shiva.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="02:17:51.625"
        end="02:17:56.833"><span region="Default">You've worshipped me and cursed me,<br/>but I was always on your mind.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="02:17:57.625"
        end="02:17:59.416"><span region="Default">And you thought I wouldn't come?</span></p>
      <p
        begin="02:18:01.458"
        end="02:18:03.625"><span region="Default">Even the Almighty was left speechless.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="02:18:04.458"
        end="02:18:09.000"><span region="Default">You blessed me with a wondrous devotee<br/>in the form of Akhanda.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="02:18:09.958"
        end="02:18:10.875"><span region="Default">That's why,</span></p>
      <p
        begin="02:18:11.791"
        end="02:18:13.500"><span region="Default">I'm granting his mother a boon.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="02:18:16.291"
        end="02:18:18.291"><span region="Default">To my mother, I grant this boon.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="02:18:22.333"
        end="02:18:24.208"><span region="Default">May you become one with the divine.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="02:18:56.083"
        end="02:19:01.041"><span region="Default">Shiva! Shiva! Shiva!<br/>Shiva! Shiva! Shiva! Come!</span></p>
      <p
        begin="02:19:01.291"
        end="02:19:06.250"><span region="Default">Hara! Hara! Hara! Hara!<br/>Hara! Hara! Come!</span></p>
      <p
        begin="02:19:06.541"
        end="02:19:11.458"><span region="Default">Shiva! Shiva! Shiva!<br/>Shiva! Shiva! Shiva! Come!</span></p>
      <p
        begin="02:19:11.833"
        end="02:19:17.000"><span region="Default">Hara! Hara! Hara! Hara!<br/>Hara! Hara! Come!</span></p>
      <p
        begin="02:19:17.250"
        end="02:19:19.041"><span region="Default">-Uncle.<br/>-Dear.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="02:19:19.791"
        end="02:19:21.625"><span region="Default">They've completed the funeral rites.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="02:19:22.375"
        end="02:19:25.791"><span region="Default">At last,<br/>that mother's last wish was granted.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="02:19:26.291"
        end="02:19:30.875"><span region="Default">The one we thought would never return<br/>came to perform her final rites.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="02:19:31.041"
        end="02:19:34.083"><span region="Default">Lord Akhanda came down himself<br/>and performed her last rites.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="02:19:59.458"
        end="02:20:00.416"><span region="Default">Baba…</span></p>
      <p
        begin="02:20:01.541"
        end="02:20:04.541"><span region="Default">I can't believe<br/>I misjudged someone so divine.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="02:20:05.458"
        end="02:20:06.375"><span region="Default">Sorry.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="02:20:10.333"
        end="02:20:11.291"><span region="Default">Sorry.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="02:20:13.166"
        end="02:20:15.083"><span region="Default">O Gangadhara Shankara</span></p>
      <p
        begin="02:20:15.166"
        end="02:20:17.000"><span region="Default">Savior across the ocean<br/>Of worldly suffering</span></p>
      <p
        begin="02:20:17.083"
        end="02:20:20.166"><span region="Default">Your fierce cosmic dance resounds</span></p>
      <p
        begin="02:20:21.166"
        end="02:20:24.958"><span region="Default">O radiant One<br/>Hail Rudra, the Destroyer</span></p>
      <p
        begin="02:20:25.125"
        end="02:20:28.250"><span region="Default">Your drum echoes with its eternal thump</span></p>
      <p
        begin="02:20:28.333"
        end="02:20:32.125"><span region="Default">O Shankara</span></p>
      <p
        begin="02:20:32.333"
        end="02:20:35.208"><span region="Default">Bestower of luck</span></p>
      <p
        begin="02:20:36.333"
        end="02:20:40.166"><span region="Default">O Shankara</span></p>
      <p
        begin="02:20:40.333"
        end="02:20:43.208"><span region="Default">Bestower of luck</span></p>
      <p
        begin="02:20:44.875"
        end="02:20:48.083"><span region="Default">Lord of the three worlds<br/>Bestower of auspiciousness</span></p>
      <p
        begin="02:20:48.166"
        end="02:20:52.208"><span region="Default">O mighty destroyer of three realms</span></p>
      <p
        begin="02:20:52.666"
        end="02:20:56.000"><span region="Default">Lord of all realms</span></p>
      <p
        begin="02:20:56.083"
        end="02:21:00.291"><span region="Default">The one who inspires warriors</span></p>
      <p
        begin="02:21:00.875"
        end="02:21:04.041"><span region="Default">O Maheshwara, beyond time itself</span></p>
      <p
        begin="02:21:04.125"
        end="02:21:06.875"><span region="Default">You're the master of all creation</span></p>
      <p
        begin="02:21:06.958"
        end="02:21:12.041"><span region="Default">O fearsome one</span></p>
      <p
        begin="02:21:12.666"
        end="02:21:15.875"><span region="Default">They say a mother and child's bond<br/>spans seven lives.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="02:21:17.041"
        end="02:21:18.250"><span region="Default">Following Lord Shiva's decree,</span></p>
      <p
        begin="02:21:19.125"
        end="02:21:21.541"><span region="Default">if fate grants me another life,<br/>I'll return the favor.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="02:21:49.250"
        end="02:21:53.166"><span region="Default">O Shankara</span></p>
      <p
        begin="02:21:53.375"
        end="02:21:56.291"><span region="Default">O Srivara</span></p>
      <p
        begin="02:21:57.250"
        end="02:22:01.125"><span region="Default">O Shankara</span></p>
      <p
        begin="02:22:01.333"
        end="02:22:04.208"><span region="Default">O Srivara</span></p>
      <p
        begin="02:22:14.125"
        end="02:22:15.041"><span region="Default">Go, my child.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="02:22:16.583"
        end="02:22:18.375"><span region="Default">The nation is God's own reflection,<br/>my child.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="02:22:18.541"
        end="02:22:21.000"><span region="Default">Life itself<br/>is the embodiment of Lord Shiva.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="02:22:21.958"
        end="02:22:26.375"><span region="Default">To protect those lives, you acted<br/>like a true sage and risked your own.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="02:22:26.791"
        end="02:22:27.708"><span region="Default">You're blessed, my child.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="02:22:29.416"
        end="02:22:30.791"><span region="Default">You've gained the divine's grace<br/>and moved its heart.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="02:22:31.916"
        end="02:22:35.500"><span region="Default">May you live a long life!</span></p>
      <p
        begin="02:22:43.375"
        end="02:22:46.250"><span region="Default">What about you, Baba?</span></p>
      <p
        begin="02:22:47.125"
        end="02:22:51.333"><span region="Default">The man who rose against my nation,<br/>duty, and God is still alive, my child.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="02:22:51.833"
        end="02:22:53.958"><span region="Default">I've got things to take care of.<br/>You should go now.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="02:22:54.666"
        end="02:22:57.375"><span region="Default">Sir, if you march into<br/>those borders with such fury…</span></p>
      <p
        begin="02:22:57.458"
        end="02:22:58.625"><span region="Default">This will trigger a war.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="02:22:59.750"
        end="02:23:01.083"><span region="Default">I'm headed to war.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="02:23:04.000"
        end="02:23:06.666"><span region="Default">If you want it in your words,<br/>I'm going in for a surgical strike.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="02:23:15.333"
        end="02:23:17.500"><span region="Default">Sir, if war breaks out,<br/>we'll be forced to fight.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="02:23:17.666"
        end="02:23:20.125"><span region="Default">You fight for the country.<br/>We fight for righteousness.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="02:23:20.875"
        end="02:23:22.416"><span region="Default">Your limit ends at the border.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="02:23:22.833"
        end="02:23:24.875"><span region="Default">Our realm is the forsaken universe.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="02:23:27.791"
        end="02:23:32.458"><span region="Default">You and I may sound the same,<br/>but both are not the same.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="02:23:35.875"
        end="02:23:37.875"><span region="Default">You use punishment to protect the nation.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="02:23:38.000"
        end="02:23:42.500"><span region="Default">If they come near our divine,<br/>they'll be torn and ripped apart.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="02:23:58.916"
        end="02:24:00.916"><span region="Default">General, any update?</span></p>
      <p
        begin="02:24:01.625"
        end="02:24:04.583"><span region="Default">There's no sign of the antidote<br/>or the scientist.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="02:24:05.125"
        end="02:24:07.250"><span region="Default">We'll implement Plan B right away.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="02:24:12.000"
        end="02:24:13.625"><span region="Default">This is a very dangerous move.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="02:24:15.250"
        end="02:24:16.791"><span region="Default">-Sir…<br/>-Be ready.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="02:24:17.916"
        end="02:24:18.875"><span region="Default">General sir!</span></p>
      <p
        begin="02:24:21.791"
        end="02:24:23.083"><span region="Default">I WISH YOU HAPPINESS AND GOOD HEALTH</span></p>
      <p
        begin="02:24:25.250"
        end="02:24:26.416"><span region="Default">Where is the antidote?</span></p>
      <p
        begin="02:24:29.000"
        end="02:24:30.583"><span region="Default">God has taken it.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="02:24:36.708"
        end="02:24:40.083"><span region="Default">You started this to make them believe…</span></p>
      <p
        begin="02:24:40.625"
        end="02:24:43.166"><span region="Default">that there's no God<br/>and he won't help when there's a need.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="02:24:44.291"
        end="02:24:45.333"><span region="Default">But that isn't true!</span></p>
      <p
        begin="02:24:47.333"
        end="02:24:49.541"><span region="Default">He exists. He has come to help.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="02:24:50.708"
        end="02:24:52.833"><span region="Default">Stop everything now. Quit it!</span></p>
      <p
        begin="02:24:53.250"
        end="02:24:56.583"><span region="Default">-Who is it?<br/>-The Lord who wields the trident.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="02:24:57.791"
        end="02:24:59.833"><span region="Default">Shiva… the one who opened his third eye!</span></p>
      <p
        begin="02:25:00.541"
        end="02:25:03.333"><span region="Default">The one who brought down…</span></p>
      <p
        begin="02:25:03.708"
        end="02:25:07.291"><span region="Default">all the demons in seconds, sir.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="02:25:12.875"
        end="02:25:13.833"><span region="Default">Tell him, General!</span></p>
      <p
        begin="02:25:14.958"
        end="02:25:19.583"><span region="Default">Enough of what you've done.<br/>One more mistake…</span></p>
      <p
        begin="02:25:20.541"
        end="02:25:23.666"><span region="Default">and his next step<br/>will land him right here.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="02:25:25.083"
        end="02:25:27.000"><span region="Default">Let's run away.<br/>Let's run away.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="02:25:29.750"
        end="02:25:31.333"><span region="Default">You seem scared for no reason.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="02:25:31.416"
        end="02:25:35.416"><span region="Default">He's right! It's God who has come.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="02:25:44.125"
        end="02:25:46.500"><span region="Default">-How did you get here?<br/>-I followed the trail.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="02:25:47.208"
        end="02:25:50.625"><span region="Default">You wanted me to convey a message<br/>to God the other day. I did.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="02:25:53.541"
        end="02:25:57.166"><span region="Default">-What did your god say?<br/>-He said not to look for him.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="02:25:57.625"
        end="02:26:00.875"><span region="Default">He'll come for you himself and kill you.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="02:26:01.000"
        end="02:26:04.583"><span region="Default">-He'll come looking for me?<br/>-It's not him you're dealing with.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="02:26:05.416"
        end="02:26:06.708"><span region="Default">But the nation!</span></p>
      <p
        begin="02:26:07.500"
        end="02:26:09.416"><span region="Default">The dharma he believes in…</span></p>
      <p
        begin="02:26:09.916"
        end="02:26:11.250"><span region="Default">and the God!</span></p>
      <p
        begin="02:26:11.333"
        end="02:26:16.625"><span region="Default">Do you know how many guns<br/>are guarding this place right now?</span></p>
      <p
        begin="02:26:17.041"
        end="02:26:21.041"><span region="Default">Do you know how many war<br/>tanks would protect me?</span></p>
      <p
        begin="02:26:21.208"
        end="02:26:25.083"><span region="Default">Do you know how many satellites<br/>are watching over me like hawks?</span></p>
      <p
        begin="02:26:26.041"
        end="02:26:28.708"><span region="Default">You're talking about the army<br/>that you appointed.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="02:26:29.166"
        end="02:26:33.583"><span region="Default">I'm talking about the soldier<br/>God created to protect dharma.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="02:26:33.750"
        end="02:26:38.250"><span region="Default">General, we only know of the Buddha<br/>who spread peace.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="02:26:38.791"
        end="02:26:41.625"><span region="Default">But they also know Rudra,<br/>the one who wages war.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="02:26:43.291"
        end="02:26:47.708"><span region="Default">You know that too,<br/>having read the holy Bhagavad Gita.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="02:26:48.000"
        end="02:26:51.208"><span region="Default">That Lord Krishna<br/>laid himself down for war.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="02:26:51.333"
        end="02:26:54.000"><span region="Default">War is in the DNA of Indians.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="02:26:54.166"
        end="02:26:56.375"><span region="Default">Their gods taught it to them themselves.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="02:26:57.416"
        end="02:27:00.541"><span region="Default">Their land follows Maruti in devotion,<br/>Rama in virtue…</span></p>
      <p
        begin="02:27:00.625"
        end="02:27:05.791"><span region="Default">Krishna in customs, and Rudra in fury.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="02:27:06.500"
        end="02:27:09.166"><span region="Default">You joined him,<br/>even after knowing all this?</span></p>
      <p
        begin="02:27:09.791"
        end="02:27:12.833"><span region="Default">How dare he cross the border<br/>and hit me on my own land?</span></p>
      <p
        begin="02:27:14.625"
        end="02:27:20.166"><span region="Default">Their race existed long before borders<br/>and boundaries were created.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="02:27:21.041"
        end="02:27:23.416"><span region="Default">The Himalayas are his abode.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="02:27:23.500"
        end="02:27:25.291"><span region="Default">The air here is under his control.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="02:27:25.541"
        end="02:27:27.416"><span region="Default">The flowing water is under his control.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="02:27:27.708"
        end="02:27:30.166"><span region="Default">All four directions<br/>are under his control.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="02:27:30.375"
        end="02:27:33.125"><span region="Default">Even Kailash obeys when he calls.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="02:27:33.333"
        end="02:27:34.958"><span region="Default">Kailash obeys him?</span></p>
      <p
        begin="02:27:35.541"
        end="02:27:38.375"><span region="Default">I'll strike Kailash itself, then.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="02:27:39.166"
        end="02:27:40.041"><span region="Default">Watch out!</span></p>
      <p
        begin="02:27:45.958"
        end="02:27:46.833"><span region="Default">Hey, stop!</span></p>
      <p
        begin="02:27:47.125"
        end="02:27:48.000"><span region="Default">Hey, General!</span></p>
      <p
        begin="02:27:49.000"
        end="02:27:50.541"><span region="Default">-Enough of what was done.<br/>-Oh, Lord!</span></p>
      <p
        begin="02:27:50.625"
        end="02:27:55.625"><span region="Default">I'll make sure no god exists<br/>in that nation that killed my son.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="02:27:55.750"
        end="02:27:56.625"><span region="Default">Fire!</span></p>
      <p
        begin="02:28:20.916"
        end="02:28:24.708"><span region="Default">Look! Look at that nation,<br/>clad in saffron.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="02:28:33.541"
        end="02:28:36.083"><span region="Default">Look at the Lord who wields the trident!</span></p>
      <p
        begin="02:28:39.666"
        end="02:28:42.833"><span region="Default">Sharabham, Master of the Vedas,<br/>has come for war.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="02:28:46.250"
        end="02:28:48.625"><span region="Default">Who will stop the mountain of sacred ash?</span></p>
      <p
        begin="02:28:48.791"
        end="02:28:49.708"><span region="Default">Stop it!</span></p>
      <p
        begin="02:28:52.750"
        end="02:28:54.541"><span region="Default">Fire!</span></p>
      <p
        begin="02:29:19.625"
        end="02:29:20.916"><span region="Default">Fire!</span></p>
      <p
        begin="02:29:29.208"
        end="02:29:30.666"><span region="Default">Shiva! Shiva! Shiva!</span></p>
      <p
        begin="02:29:33.625"
        end="02:29:36.583"><span region="Default">Who is it that dared to touch my land?</span></p>
      <p
        begin="02:29:50.291"
        end="02:29:53.750"><span region="Default">Who is it that dared to touch<br/>the spirit of my people?</span></p>
      <p
        begin="02:30:17.666"
        end="02:30:22.666"><span region="Default">Who tainted the water on my land<br/>and blamed my Lord?</span></p>
      <p
        begin="02:30:24.291"
        end="02:30:25.291"><span region="Default">Who is it?</span></p>
      <p
        begin="02:30:25.375"
        end="02:30:27.500"><span region="Default">-That's me!<br/>-Hey!</span></p>
      <p
        begin="02:31:00.083"
        end="02:31:01.500"><span region="Default">Hey!</span></p>
      <p
        begin="02:31:35.625"
        end="02:31:39.291"><span region="Default">Shock drags. This is the time.<br/>You need to activate now!</span></p>
      <p
        begin="02:32:14.375"
        end="02:32:20.291"><span region="Default">-Unbroken cosmic dance<br/>-Hail Lord Mahadev!</span></p>
      <p
        begin="02:32:20.375"
        end="02:32:24.375"><span region="Default">Unbroken cosmic dance</span></p>
      <p
        begin="02:32:43.791"
        end="02:32:49.625"><span region="Default">Hey! We built a dam,<br/>and it changed the Earth's very speed.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="02:32:50.166"
        end="02:32:54.541"><span region="Default">The world shook when we built the wall.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="02:32:54.916"
        end="02:32:59.875"><span region="Default">On my command, any boundary<br/>will shift and become ours.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="02:33:00.541"
        end="02:33:03.875"><span region="Default">That's our history!<br/>That's our power!</span></p>
      <p
        begin="02:33:05.291"
        end="02:33:07.375"><span region="Default">And you dare strike us, the powerful?</span></p>
      <p
        begin="02:33:08.458"
        end="02:33:10.416"><span region="Default">I'll strike your God now.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="02:33:11.500"
        end="02:33:13.833"><span region="Default">I'll strike your Kailash!<br/>Try and stop me.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="02:33:16.958"
        end="02:33:17.916"><span region="Default">Move!</span></p>
      <p
        begin="02:33:23.833"
        end="02:33:25.416"><span region="Default">Aim at the Kailash!</span></p>
      <p
        begin="02:33:41.083"
        end="02:33:42.041"><span region="Default">Go!</span></p>
      <p
        begin="02:33:52.833"
        end="02:33:54.208"><span region="Default">Fire!</span></p>
      <p
        begin="02:33:55.791"
        end="02:33:57.541"><span region="Default">Shambho…</span></p>
      <p
        begin="02:34:00.833"
        end="02:34:02.583"><span region="Default">Shankara!</span></p>
      <p
        begin="02:34:12.541"
        end="02:34:13.958"><span region="Default">The Destroyer of Time…</span></p>
      <p
        begin="02:34:17.125"
        end="02:34:18.541"><span region="Default">The Destroyer of Pain…</span></p>
      <p
        begin="02:34:21.666"
        end="02:34:23.125"><span region="Default">The Destroyer of Sin…</span></p>
      <p
        begin="02:34:26.083"
        end="02:34:27.625"><span region="Default">The Destroyer of Fear…</span></p>
      <p
        begin="02:34:31.375"
        end="02:34:34.208"><span region="Default">Hail Lord Mahadev!</span></p>
      <p
        begin="02:34:40.583"
        end="02:34:42.000"><span region="Default">Kill him mercilessly!</span></p>
      <p
        begin="02:34:46.166"
        end="02:34:47.250"><span region="Default">Don't leave him!</span></p>
      <p
        begin="02:34:56.750"
        end="02:35:00.333"><span region="Default">Shiva! Shiva! Shiva! Shambho!</span></p>
      <p
        begin="02:35:04.125"
        end="02:35:06.083"><span region="Default">Shambho…</span></p>
      <p
        begin="02:35:27.125"
        end="02:35:29.000"><span region="Default">I bow to Lord Shiva!</span></p>
      <p
        begin="02:36:18.208"
        end="02:36:19.083"><span region="Default">Hey!</span></p>
      <p
        begin="02:36:24.958"
        end="02:36:26.041"><span region="Default">You think yours is history?</span></p>
      <p
        begin="02:36:27.208"
        end="02:36:31.291"><span region="Default">Even a tree by the sacred Ganga<br/>holds more history than you.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="02:36:31.458"
        end="02:36:32.708"><span region="Default">You call that history?</span></p>
      <p
        begin="02:36:33.833"
        end="02:36:36.875"><span region="Default">You built a wall fearing a thief.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="02:36:37.416"
        end="02:36:41.666"><span region="Default">We crossed continents, leveled mountains,<br/>and raised the saffron high.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="02:36:44.250"
        end="02:36:46.875"><span region="Default">You eat lizards in the mountains.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="02:36:47.541"
        end="02:36:50.750"><span region="Default">We shape every mountain<br/>into a holy place and worship it.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="02:36:51.875"
        end="02:36:53.875"><span region="Default">You're the one<br/>who feeds worms with mere sticks.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="02:36:54.416"
        end="02:36:56.541"><span region="Default">We make children recite the holy Vedas!</span></p>
      <p
        begin="02:37:00.041"
        end="02:37:02.041"><span region="Default">You are hated by the world.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="02:37:03.000"
        end="02:37:04.958"><span region="Default">We are growing<br/>as the world's guiding light.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="02:37:05.750"
        end="02:37:09.416"><span region="Default">Your history is tyranny.<br/>Ours is endless.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="02:37:10.041"
        end="02:37:12.750"><span region="Default">-How dare you touch my country?<br/>-Hey!</span></p>
      <p
        begin="02:37:13.791"
        end="02:37:15.000"><span region="Default">He's our general!</span></p>
      <p
        begin="02:37:15.625"
        end="02:37:18.625"><span region="Default">If anything happens to him,<br/>our whole nation will rise.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="02:37:26.708"
        end="02:37:29.875"><span region="Default">What is your nation?<br/>Where is it? Where?</span></p>
      <p
        begin="02:37:31.291"
        end="02:37:33.250"><span region="Default">Let alone my nation and my God…</span></p>
      <p
        begin="02:37:34.000"
        end="02:37:37.625"><span region="Default">if you dare lay a hand<br/>on our women's vermilion,</span></p>
      <p
        begin="02:37:37.958"
        end="02:37:40.708"><span region="Default">you'll see a tide of blood surge<br/>from every wiped vermilion</span></p>
      <p
        begin="02:37:40.791"
        end="02:37:43.708"><span region="Default">and a firestorm rise<br/>from the breath of the dead!</span></p>
      <p
        begin="02:37:45.958"
        end="02:37:48.833"><span region="Default">No matter how many dogs<br/>and foxes like you protect him,</span></p>
      <p
        begin="02:37:49.250"
        end="02:37:53.333"><span region="Default">the sound of our soldiers' swords<br/>breaking the skulls of such maniacs</span></p>
      <p
        begin="02:37:53.541"
        end="02:37:55.666"><span region="Default">will be more terrifying than any war.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="02:37:56.166"
        end="02:37:57.375"><span region="Default">Do you dare?</span></p>
      <p
        begin="02:37:58.500"
        end="02:38:00.000"><span region="Default">For someone who has read<br/>the Bhagavad Gita,</span></p>
      <p
        begin="02:38:00.375"
        end="02:38:03.666"><span region="Default">don't you know<br/>that we made rocks float on water?</span></p>
      <p
        begin="02:38:03.750"
        end="02:38:07.541"><span region="Default">Don't you know that Indians<br/>built a bridge across the ocean</span></p>
      <p
        begin="02:38:07.625"
        end="02:38:08.958"><span region="Default">to uphold dharma?</span></p>
      <p
        begin="02:38:09.458"
        end="02:38:14.166"><span region="Default">Don't you know that the technology is born<br/>from the knowledge of our divine Vedas?</span></p>
      <p
        begin="02:38:15.375"
        end="02:38:19.125"><span region="Default">Don't you know India is God's own form?</span></p>
      <p
        begin="02:38:20.375"
        end="02:38:23.791"><span region="Default">You've only seen our nation's form<br/>on the world map.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="02:38:24.666"
        end="02:38:27.083"><span region="Default">You've never seen its true form.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="02:38:28.166"
        end="02:38:30.333"><span region="Default">When we rise and roar,</span></p>
      <p
        begin="02:38:30.916"
        end="02:38:32.875"><span region="Default">only silence follows in the world.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="02:38:48.666"
        end="02:38:49.541"><span region="Default">Go!</span></p>
      <p
        begin="02:38:50.041"
        end="02:38:52.458"><span region="Default">With the mouth that said,<br/>"God doesn't exist. He won't come."</span></p>
      <p
        begin="02:38:52.666"
        end="02:38:55.041"><span region="Default">Now say, "God exists. He has come.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="02:38:55.500"
        end="02:38:57.625"><span region="Default">That he lives among and for his people."</span></p>
      <p
        begin="02:38:58.083"
        end="02:39:00.875"><span region="Default">Tell them He appears<br/>whenever dharma is threatened.</span></p>
      <p
        begin="02:39:02.125"
        end="02:39:03.250"><span region="Default">Oh, Lord!</span></p>
      <p
        begin="02:39:13.416"
        end="02:39:15.291"><span region="Default">Eternal Haindavam</span></p>
      <p
        begin="02:39:15.375"
        end="02:39:17.666"><span region="Default">Haindavam!<br/>Haindavam!</span></p>
      <p
        begin="02:39:17.750"
        end="02:39:19.958"><span region="Default">The glory of creation itself</span></p>
      <p
        begin="02:39:20.083"
        end="02:39:22.583"><span region="Default">The power of new beginnings</span></p>
      <p
        begin="02:39:22.875"
        end="02:39:24.750"><span region="Default">Infinite Haindavam</span></p>
      <p
        begin="02:39:24.833"
        end="02:39:27.083"><span region="Default">Haindavam!<br/>Haindavam!</span></p>
      <p
        begin="02:39:27.208"
        end="02:39:29.500"><span region="Default">The sacred sound of<br/>The primordial resonance</span></p>
      <p
        begin="02:39:29.583"
        end="02:39:31.958"><span region="Default">The hue of the soul's story</span></p>
      <p
        begin="02:39:32.416"
        end="02:39:34.750"><span region="Default">Born of the prescribed rules of<br/>The Vedas and Vedanta</span></p>
      <p
        begin="02:39:34.833"
        end="02:39:37.083"><span region="Default">This is the highest divine law</span></p>
      <p
        begin="02:39:37.166"
        end="02:39:39.541"><span region="Default">It links narratives of all ages</span></p>
      <p
        begin="02:39:39.625"
        end="02:39:41.875"><span region="Default">And righteous action forms<br/>The dharma of every era</span></p>
      <p
        begin="02:39:41.958"
        end="02:39:44.250"><span region="Default">The pure essence of the five elements</span></p>
      <p
        begin="02:39:44.333"
        end="02:39:46.541"><span region="Default">The essence of all principles<br/>The sound of Om</span></p>
      <p
        begin="02:39:46.666"
        end="02:39:48.958"><span region="Default">Uplifting temples and humanity<br/>Through Manusmriti</span></p>
      <p
        begin="02:39:49.041"
        end="02:39:51.291"><span region="Default">Dharma shines like a radiant gem</span></p>
      <p
        begin="02:39:51.375"
        end="02:39:53.666"><span region="Default">The rich song of all noble thoughts</span></p>
      <p
        begin="02:39:53.750"
        end="02:39:56.083"><span region="Default">The bright dawn of ancient wisdom in<br/>Smriti and the Puranas</span></p>
      <p
        begin="02:39:56.166"
        end="02:39:58.458"><span region="Default">Flowing like a Vedic temple</span></p>
      <p
        begin="02:39:58.541"
        end="02:40:00.750"><span region="Default">Dharma holds everything together</span></p>
      <p
        begin="02:40:00.833"
        end="02:40:05.291"><span region="Default">The beautiful life's principle</span></p>
      <p
        begin="02:40:05.375"
        end="02:40:07.958"><span region="Default">Filled with virtue, brings joy to all</span></p>
      <p
        begin="02:40:08.041"
        end="02:40:10.166"><span region="Default">This is the matchless<br/>Great eternal dharma</span></p>
      <p
        begin="02:40:10.416"
        end="02:40:14.958"><span region="Default">It's the ancient path<br/>May the path be victorious</span></p>
      <p
        begin="02:40:15.208"
        end="02:40:19.500"><span region="Default">In eternally pure time<br/>It's the constant cosmic play</span></p>
      <p
        begin="02:40:19.916"
        end="02:40:24.541"><span region="Default">The Lord's rhythmic nectar is eternal</span></p>
      <p
        begin="02:40:24.625"
        end="02:40:26.791"><span region="Default">Destroyer of delusion and worlds</span></p>
      <p
        begin="02:40:26.875"
        end="02:40:29.458"><span region="Default">Three-eyed Lord of three realms!</span></p>
      <p
        begin="02:40:29.541"
        end="02:40:32.583"><span region="Default">The celebrated Lord of Gauri</span></p>
      <p
        begin="02:40:32.666"
        end="02:40:34.000"><span region="Default">His roar is mighty!</span></p>
      <p
        begin="02:40:34.125"
        end="02:40:37.708"><span region="Default">Meditate on the sound of Om!</span></p>
      <p
        begin="02:40:37.833"
        end="02:40:38.875"><span region="Default">Shivam! Shankaram!</span></p>
      <p
        begin="02:40:38.958"
        end="02:40:41.250"><span region="Default">Shambhala<br/>O Ishwara!</span></p>
      <p
        begin="02:40:41.333"
        end="02:40:43.625"><span region="Default">Shambhala<br/>O Maheshwara!</span></p>
      <p
        begin="02:40:43.708"
        end="02:40:46.000"><span region="Default">Shambhala<br/>O Shankara!</span></p>
      <p
        begin="02:40:46.083"
        end="02:40:48.333"><span region="Default">Shambhala<br/>O Tandava!</span></p>
      <p
        begin="02:40:48.416"
        end="02:40:50.708"><span region="Default">Shambhala<br/>O Ishwara!</span></p>
      <p
        begin="02:40:50.791"
        end="02:40:53.041"><span region="Default">Shambhala<br/>O Maheshwara!</span></p>
      <p
        begin="02:40:53.125"
        end="02:40:55.458"><span region="Default">Shambhala<br/>O Shankara!</span></p>
      <p
        begin="02:40:55.541"
        end="02:40:56.916"><span region="Default">SHAMBHALA</span></p>
      <p
        begin="02:44:01.125"
        end="02:44:08.125"><span region="Default">HAIL AKHANDA</span></p>
    </div>
  </body>
</tt>
